(509001, 49776, 10785, '<td valign="top">I thought I had self-control issues... Oi Vay!<br/>This one''s rather dark. Shine some light on the lock.<br/> It''s interesting, but the clutter on the front of the fridge needs to be removed.<br/>Straighten up that edge on the fridge to be vertical in the frame, or else make it much more abstract by greatly increasing the angle.<br/>A portrait style crop would have been interesting too. More height, less width.<br/>I can''t think of any more comments! Hope those help!</td>', 'I thought I had self-control issues... Oi Vay!This one''s rather dark. Shine some light on the lock. It''s interesting, but the clutter on the front of the fridge needs to be removed.Straighten up that edge on the fridge to be vertical in the frame, or else make it much more abstract by greatly increasing the angle.A portrait style crop would have been interesting too. More height, less width.I can''t think of any more comments! Hope those help!', '2003-12-10 09:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
