(509135, 50067, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot. Light is very good. The background on the other hand is incredibly busy and really detracts from the simplicity of the mood. 6</td>', 'This is an excellent shot. Light is very good. The background on the other hand is incredibly busy and really detracts from the simplicity of the mood. 6', '2003-12-10 10:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
