(509201, 50125, 13759, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I can only see a complex arrangement of materials. To me it´s a good still life not a simplicity itself.</td>', 'Sorry, but I can only see a complex arrangement of materials. To me it´s a good still life not a simplicity itself.', '2003-12-10 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
