(509702, 50099, 13136, '<td valign="top">Lots-o-trees. It looks like it''s in color. Maybe conversion to B&amp;W would add a bit of contrast. Otherwise, Good shot. I like the hazing off in the distance.</td>', 'Lots-o-trees. It looks like it''s in color. Maybe conversion to B&W would add a bit of contrast. Otherwise, Good shot. I like the hazing off in the distance.', '2003-12-10 15:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(509703, 50112, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Clear, crisp, in focus and well framed. Maybe just a bit too bright (not much). Good picture.</td>', 'Nice shot. Clear, crisp, in focus and well framed. Maybe just a bit too bright (not much). Good picture.', '2003-12-10 15:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(509704, 50272, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect around the candle flame. I would still like to see the person''s face though. Unique picture.</td>', 'Interesting effect around the candle flame. I would still like to see the person''s face though. Unique picture.', '2003-12-10 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(509706, 50270, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits nicely. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good. Not sure if it''s an optical illusion or not, but the bottom two sets of leaves almost look doubled or blurred.<br/> <br/>Personal: Very nice to look at, good contrast. I like it!<br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits nicely. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good. Not sure if it''s an optical illusion or not, but the bottom two sets of leaves almost look doubled or blurred. Personal: Very nice to look at, good contrast. I like it! My vote: 8', '2003-12-10 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(509707, 50077, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one fits nicely. Exposure composition focus lighting all very nice.<br/> <br/>Personal: Love the photo. The border is overbearing for my tastes. I''d like to see more of that "screen real estate" used up by the photo itself!<br/> <br/>My vote: 7<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one fits nicely. Exposure composition focus lighting all very nice. Personal: Love the photo. The border is overbearing for my tastes. I''d like to see more of that "screen real estate" used up by the photo itself! My vote: 7', '2003-12-10 15:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(509708, 50332, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good. <br/> <br/>Personal: Nicely done.<br/> <br/>My vote: 6<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. Exposure composition focus lighting all good.  Personal: Nicely done. My vote: 6', '2003-12-10 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(509709, 49845, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The bowl works with the white background better than most other white backgounds I see. Well focused and lit. I like the slightly off-center aspect as well.</td>', 'Very nice. The bowl works with the white background better than most other white backgounds I see. Well focused and lit. I like the slightly off-center aspect as well.', '2003-12-10 15:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(509711, 50091, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, but nothing really special. Good, but not great.</td>', 'Nice sunset, but nothing really special. Good, but not great.', '2003-12-10 15:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(509712, 50068, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interrogation should put ONE of the chairs in the spotlight. Need to have the rest of the room dark. Picture is a bit too grainy.</td>', 'Interrogation should put ONE of the chairs in the spotlight. Need to have the rest of the room dark. Picture is a bit too grainy.', '2003-12-10 15:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(509713, 50259, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge, but this one not as strongly as the others for me. Exposure composition focus lighting okay, but the reflections in the cat''s eyes is distracting and the crop is too tight for my taste, particularly with the look on the cat''s face. <br/> <br/>Personal: This looks like a stressed cat, this doesn''t say simplicity to me. It doesn''t look like much more than a snapshot. It appears to be properly exposed, but by the same token it looks too bright to me. Definitely worth the time to keep practicing!<br/> <br/>These are the exact same comments I left for the other cat face shot, because they are so similar, even down to the color of the cat.<br/> <br/>My vote: 3<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge, but this one not as strongly as the others for me. Exposure composition focus lighting okay, but the reflections in the cat''s eyes is distracting and the crop is too tight for my taste, particularly with the look on the cat''s face.  Personal: This looks like a stressed cat, this doesn''t say simplicity to me. It doesn''t look like much more than a snapshot. It appears to be properly exposed, but by the same token it looks too bright to me. Definitely worth the time to keep practicing! These are the exact same comments I left for the other cat face shot, because they are so similar, even down to the color of the cat. My vote: 3', '2003-12-10 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(509716, 49808, 13136, '<td valign="top">Contrasting views between clouds and mountains is nice. Lack of focus on mountains detracts from the picture.</td>', 'Contrasting views between clouds and mountains is nice. Lack of focus on mountains detracts from the picture.', '2003-12-10 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(509717, 50034, 13136, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clear, very nice close-up of a flower. Simple layout fulfills the challenge. Personally, I''m not fond of flower shots, but this is nice.</td>', 'Crisp, clear, very nice close-up of a flower. Simple layout fulfills the challenge. Personally, I''m not fond of flower shots, but this is nice.', '2003-12-10 15:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(509718, 50306, 259, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2003-12-10 15:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(509719, 50077, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very good. A standout shot in this challenge. My only maybe is the branch running off the picture on the right. Therwise, an excellent shot. I like the cropping very much.</td>', 'Very good. A standout shot in this challenge. My only maybe is the branch running off the picture on the right. Therwise, an excellent shot. I like the cropping very much.', '2003-12-10 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(509720, 50223, 259, '<td valign="top">awsome.  the contrast between the red and blue is very nice.</td>', 'awsome.  the contrast between the red and blue is very nice.', '2003-12-10 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(509721, 50266, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I think I would have used a more offset light for less glare and longer shadows. Good picture.</td>', 'Good concept. I think I would have used a more offset light for less glare and longer shadows. Good picture.', '2003-12-10 15:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(509722, 49874, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one fits very well. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. I love the shadow and I think the "hot spot" on the cherry adds to the photo. I''m sure others won''t agree.<br/> <br/>Personal: Wouldn''t change a thing.<br/> <br/>My vote: 10<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one fits very well. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. I love the shadow and I think the "hot spot" on the cherry adds to the photo. I''m sure others won''t agree. Personal: Wouldn''t change a thing. My vote: 10', '2003-12-10 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(509723, 50317, 259, '<td valign="top">something in the foreground to divide up this photo whould help greatly.  it would create a greater sence of depth.</td>', 'something in the foreground to divide up this photo whould help greatly.  it would create a greater sence of depth.', '2003-12-10 15:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(509724, 49893, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one is perfect. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent.<br/> <br/>Personal: I have nothing to suggest, this is a perfect shot for this challenge.<br/> <br/>My vote: 10<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one is perfect. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. Personal: I have nothing to suggest, this is a perfect shot for this challenge. My vote: 10', '2003-12-10 15:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
