(509736, 49607, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This does nicely. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good.<br/> <br/>Personal: How delightfully out of place. A lovely photo.<br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This does nicely. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good. Personal: How delightfully out of place. A lovely photo. My vote: 8', '2003-12-10 15:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
