(509743, 49495, 13487, '<td valign="top">I would be interested to see the color version... christmas lights usually invoke the thought of bright and colorful.  Nice photo though.</td>', 'I would be interested to see the color version... christmas lights usually invoke the thought of bright and colorful.  Nice photo though.', '2003-12-10 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(509746, 50067, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge.  This does well. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good- this feels very Eastern, which in my mind makes it a strong match for the challenge.<br/> <br/>Personal: Very stylish looking, but I wish the handle looked more plain, cleaner, smoother.... you know what I mean? It''s nitpicky, I know.<br/> <br/>My vote: 7<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge.  This does well. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good- this feels very Eastern, which in my mind makes it a strong match for the challenge. Personal: Very stylish looking, but I wish the handle looked more plain, cleaner, smoother.... you know what I mean? It''s nitpicky, I know. My vote: 7', '2003-12-10 15:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(509767, 49900, 4008, '<td valign="top">Sorry this does not do much for me. Composition and angle of view is very standard, orange bang in the middle, too much cluttered leaves around it. Drops on the leaves are sharp but on the orange not clearly visible. Would try to make it simpler, get closer, move orange out of center.</td>', 'Sorry this does not do much for me. Composition and angle of view is very standard, orange bang in the middle, too much cluttered leaves around it. Drops on the leaves are sharp but on the orange not clearly visible. Would try to make it simpler, get closer, move orange out of center.', '2003-12-10 15:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(509770, 50149, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and I like the composition - the turtles in diagonal. Actually, the tortoise in the foreground could be sharper, and your background is distracting a bit. What about a homogenic, one-coloured one? :-)</td>', 'Very nice idea and I like the composition - the turtles in diagonal. Actually, the tortoise in the foreground could be sharper, and your background is distracting a bit. What about a homogenic, one-coloured one? :-)', '2003-12-10 15:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(509771, 50054, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits well. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good, this speaks.<br/> <br/>Personal:Very nicely done. <br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits well. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good, this speaks. Personal:Very nicely done.  My vote: 8', '2003-12-10 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(509773, 50166, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the top line, the black metal with white snow, the blurred background. The second line is not really needed. If you would have gotten closer to the top one, reduce the elements in the picture even more it would be stronger in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the top line, the black metal with white snow, the blurred background. The second line is not really needed. If you would have gotten closer to the top one, reduce the elements in the picture even more it would be stronger in my opinion.', '2003-12-10 16:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(509777, 49844, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This makes a very simple statement. Exposure composition focus lighting all great. I really like the DOF.<br/> <br/>Personal: Thank you for not taking the branch from corner to corner- I really like this composition, wouldn''t suggest a thing.<br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This makes a very simple statement. Exposure composition focus lighting all great. I really like the DOF. Personal: Thank you for not taking the branch from corner to corner- I really like this composition, wouldn''t suggest a thing. My vote: 8', '2003-12-10 16:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(509781, 50154, 4008, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my "round" challenge winner. Where was this taken ? Good steady shot. Nice contrasts. Keeping the shutter open a bit longer would have made the lights on the left also into one uninterrupted line. I find the composition a bit awkward, with the wall on the right filling the big part of the picture and the leading lines into the bend all on the left and therefore fairly short. (but it might be that I am to used to my own picture and judging from that).</td>', 'Reminds me of my "round" challenge winner. Where was this taken ? Good steady shot. Nice contrasts. Keeping the shutter open a bit longer would have made the lights on the left also into one uninterrupted line. I find the composition a bit awkward, with the wall on the right filling the big part of the picture and the leading lines into the bend all on the left and therefore fairly short. (but it might be that I am to used to my own picture and judging from that).', '2003-12-10 16:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(509782, 49899, 4008, '<td valign="top">Cut away a part of the black foreground and it becomes much more appealing.</td>', 'Cut away a part of the black foreground and it becomes much more appealing.', '2003-12-10 16:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(509787, 49792, 4008, '<td valign="top">very strange to have it B&amp;W except the blue. The effect does not add anything, just distracts.</td>', 'very strange to have it B&W except the blue. The effect does not add anything, just distracts.', '2003-12-10 16:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(509789, 50264, 4008, '<td valign="top">dramatic light, good balance provided by the bench and tree, like it a lot. Maybe add a bit more punch to the foreground by increasing contrast.</td>', 'dramatic light, good balance provided by the bench and tree, like it a lot. Maybe add a bit more punch to the foreground by increasing contrast.', '2003-12-10 16:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(509792, 49733, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great simple image with very special elements. Light is a but dull, lacks warmth in my opinion, and the reflective strip at the top should have been cropped out.</td>', 'Great simple image with very special elements. Light is a but dull, lacks warmth in my opinion, and the reflective strip at the top should have been cropped out.', '2003-12-10 16:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(509794, 50036, 4008, '<td valign="top">simple and very very lovely, nice even background, great appealing color.</td>', 'simple and very very lovely, nice even background, great appealing color.', '2003-12-10 16:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(509795, 50332, 4008, '<td valign="top">the flower itself looks rather complex, but I like the simplicity of the picture.</td>', 'the flower itself looks rather complex, but I like the simplicity of the picture.', '2003-12-10 16:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(509797, 49607, 4008, '<td valign="top">How did you get across this one, or is it set up ? I like it, it suggest a simple mind to try to heat up nature like that.</td>', 'How did you get across this one, or is it set up ? I like it, it suggest a simple mind to try to heat up nature like that.', '2003-12-10 16:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(509800, 50146, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would have cut away the lower left corner with the sharp edges, so also part of the bottom and the left. Lovely flow of colors.</td>', 'I would have cut away the lower left corner with the sharp edges, so also part of the bottom and the left. Lovely flow of colors.', '2003-12-10 16:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(509801, 50034, 14620, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful</td>', 'Simply beautiful', '2003-12-10 16:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(509804, 49611, 10625, '<td valign="top">strawberries and milk?</td>', 'strawberries and milk?', '2003-12-10 16:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(509806, 50313, 4008, '<td valign="top">Cut away 20% on the left and the composition gets much improved in my opinion. Lovely color and good sharpness.</td>', 'Cut away 20% on the left and the composition gets much improved in my opinion. Lovely color and good sharpness.', '2003-12-10 16:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(509808, 50091, 4008, '<td valign="top">few distrubing elements : the pole in the middle, the car on the right and the headlights on the left. Does not add to the beauty.</td>', 'few distrubing elements : the pole in the middle, the car on the right and the headlights on the left. Does not add to the beauty.', '2003-12-10 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(509810, 50267, 4008, '<td valign="top">Sharpness is on the crack at the back, not on the joint where it should be in my opinion.</td>', 'Sharpness is on the crack at the back, not on the joint where it should be in my opinion.', '2003-12-10 16:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
