(509840, 50287, 10858, '<td valign="top">Crop is too tight on the bottom (I should have left even distance on the left and bottom), and lighting spot is a bit distracting in the background. Otherwise I love the colours, DOF and softness here.</td>', 'Crop is too tight on the bottom (I should have left even distance on the left and bottom), and lighting spot is a bit distracting in the background. Otherwise I love the colours, DOF and softness here.', '2003-12-10 16:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(509841, 49873, 13749, '<td valign="top">if had you had the resources (maybe somebody patient enough to stand around while you were shooting), it would have been nice to place a solid background behind the icicle, for purpose of simplicity.  the shallow dof helps keep attention on the icicle, but the background is still semi-distracting due to it''s ''unsimple'' nature.</td>', 'if had you had the resources (maybe somebody patient enough to stand around while you were shooting), it would have been nice to place a solid background behind the icicle, for purpose of simplicity.  the shallow dof helps keep attention on the icicle, but the background is still semi-distracting due to it''s ''unsimple'' nature.', '2003-12-10 16:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(509844, 50092, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is simple, it''s true - I like the idea -, but there are a bit much negative space and it''s too much out of focus for my taste. 2cm crop on the left, 4 cm on the right and a bit more focus and contast would make this more effective, it''s just an opinion.</td>', 'This is simple, it''s true - I like the idea -, but there are a bit much negative space and it''s too much out of focus for my taste. 2cm crop on the left, 4 cm on the right and a bit more focus and contast would make this more effective, it''s just an opinion.', '2003-12-10 17:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
