(510260, 49792, 6668, '<td valign="top">Personally I feel this shot would be better in full black and white, to me black and white with a bit of color is only appropriate when a key element of the photo is highlighted in color, in this case, I don''t feel that the skirt is a key element or a main focal point and draws attention away from the horse and carriage. 6</td>', 'Personally I feel this shot would be better in full black and white, to me black and white with a bit of color is only appropriate when a key element of the photo is highlighted in color, in this case, I don''t feel that the skirt is a key element or a main focal point and draws attention away from the horse and carriage. 6', '2003-12-10 23:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
