(510262, 50067, 8891, '<td valign="top">OK so I know who you are and I will give it to you full throttle! Great! My only nit is the BG under the bowl and spoon lookf a bit blown out.....the rest of the exposure is wonderful and I still like how the background looks like a giant cracker. The composition however is perfect enough for me to give you a 10.  Hope you don''t get as frustrated here as I have been, but it can be quite interesting at times and you can certainly learn a thing or two.  Have fun and don''t let the overnighters get you down.   RoB</td>', 'OK so I know who you are and I will give it to you full throttle! Great! My only nit is the BG under the bowl and spoon lookf a bit blown out.....the rest of the exposure is wonderful and I still like how the background looks like a giant cracker. The composition however is perfect enough for me to give you a 10.  Hope you don''t get as frustrated here as I have been, but it can be quite interesting at times and you can certainly learn a thing or two.  Have fun and don''t let the overnighters get you down.   RoB', '2003-12-10 23:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(510263, 50038, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great idea, like the concept and the the BW is spot on....I''m just wondering what position the switch is on,   it appears to be in neutral, neither on nor off?. the position of the switch might have been placed so that it does not look so cramped but that''s about it.  Like it much.</td>', 'Great idea, like the concept and the the BW is spot on....I''m just wondering what position the switch is on,   it appears to be in neutral, neither on nor off?. the position of the switch might have been placed so that it does not look so cramped but that''s about it.  Like it much.', '2003-12-10 23:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(510264, 49482, 8891, '<td valign="top">the subject looks simple enough, but there is too much going on in the background and does not appear chaotic though I would think your title was meant as tongue in cheek.  What kills it for me is the slant and if it was meant it does nothing for me.  you might have had your subject closer to the hub-bub in the BG and had them in motion while the subject was perfectly still.  Just a thoughjt.</td>', 'the subject looks simple enough, but there is too much going on in the background and does not appear chaotic though I would think your title was meant as tongue in cheek.  What kills it for me is the slant and if it was meant it does nothing for me.  you might have had your subject closer to the hub-bub in the BG and had them in motion while the subject was perfectly still.  Just a thoughjt.', '2003-12-10 23:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(510266, 50231, 6668, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the angle of this shot, to me it almost looks like two big eyes and a nose (the vase), perhaps it would have worked better from a different perspective.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the angle of this shot, to me it almost looks like two big eyes and a nose (the vase), perhaps it would have worked better from a different perspective.', '2003-12-10 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
