(510287, 49790, 8891, '<td valign="top">this is technically a superior image.  great lighting , love the negative space here and the model looks great.  I think if you were going for simple, you might have shown the face because, to me, the image as shown is made complex by my wanting to know what the subject is going through and I am not able to tell that with his head down. I''ll let the technique out way that a bit.</td>', 'this is technically a superior image.  great lighting , love the negative space here and the model looks great.  I think if you were going for simple, you might have shown the face because, to me, the image as shown is made complex by my wanting to know what the subject is going through and I am not able to tell that with his head down. I''ll let the technique out way that a bit.', '2003-12-10 23:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(510288, 49918, 6668, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot...I predict a winner!<br/> <br/>Nice work. 10</td>', 'wonderful shot...I predict a winner! Nice work. 10', '2003-12-10 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(510289, 50214, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like this somewhat....the comp is ok but the image looks a bit cramped.  and there is that pink colorcast at the top which really kills the hi key background you might have been going for.  the lighting of the image is quite fine and the colors are great.</td>', 'I like this somewhat....the comp is ok but the image looks a bit cramped.  and there is that pink colorcast at the top which really kills the hi key background you might have been going for.  the lighting of the image is quite fine and the colors are great.', '2003-12-10 23:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(510290, 50334, 6668, '<td valign="top">sorry, but to me this is not an overly interesting photo to look at, it does meet the challenge but other than that it doesn''t do much for me, also the background is too busy and distracting as well as the white spots in the front. 4</td>', 'sorry, but to me this is not an overly interesting photo to look at, it does meet the challenge but other than that it doesn''t do much for me, also the background is too busy and distracting as well as the white spots in the front. 4', '2003-12-10 23:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(510292, 50099, 8891, '<td valign="top">just toooooooooooooooo many trees.</td>', 'just toooooooooooooooo many trees.', '2003-12-10 23:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(510294, 50324, 8891, '<td valign="top">hmmmmm.....Well I just got new glasses and a new computer so it must be picture it self which does not enable me to see what it is you are going on about.</td>', 'hmmmmm.....Well I just got new glasses and a new computer so it must be picture it self which does not enable me to see what it is you are going on about.', '2003-12-10 23:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(510296, 50199, 8891, '<td valign="top">well it is simple enough, can''t get much simpler than this subject. the composition is pretty simple as well, perhaps to much so and it borders on being to centered. While it is simple it could have been made to look more interesting by a better composed shot.</td>', 'well it is simple enough, can''t get much simpler than this subject. the composition is pretty simple as well, perhaps to much so and it borders on being to centered. While it is simple it could have been made to look more interesting by a better composed shot.', '2003-12-10 23:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(510305, 49669, 13354, '<td valign="top">Excellent control of the light. Grest composition. Well done!</td>', 'Excellent control of the light. Grest composition. Well done!', '2003-12-11 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(510306, 50229, 13354, '<td valign="top">You should have make the background blurred (if possible with your camera) to make the sculpture stand out.</td>', 'You should have make the background blurred (if possible with your camera) to make the sculpture stand out.', '2003-12-11 00:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(510307, 50302, 13354, '<td valign="top">Good composition. A bit too much contrast for my own taste, it almost seems like it was overexposed. But that is a great idea.</td>', 'Good composition. A bit too much contrast for my own taste, it almost seems like it was overexposed. But that is a great idea.', '2003-12-11 00:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(510309, 49669, 718, '<td valign="top">I love shoes. They are very shapely and interesting to look at. This piece is nice because it is naturally black and white, very simple.</td>', 'I love shoes. They are very shapely and interesting to look at. This piece is nice because it is naturally black and white, very simple.', '2003-12-11 00:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(510311, 50037, 718, '<td valign="top">Nice simple machine.</td>', 'Nice simple machine.', '2003-12-11 00:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(510313, 49850, 718, '<td valign="top">Very cool pic. I love the patterns and textures here. I can almost feel the wind.</td>', 'Very cool pic. I love the patterns and textures here. I can almost feel the wind.', '2003-12-11 00:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(510314, 50301, 13354, '<td valign="top">Great work! I like the motion of the hammer.</td>', 'Great work! I like the motion of the hammer.', '2003-12-11 00:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(510315, 49844, 718, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-12-11 00:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(510317, 50330, 718, '<td valign="top">Great frame. Simple and beutiful.</td>', 'Great frame. Simple and beutiful.', '2003-12-11 00:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(510318, 50143, 13354, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Good composition. Great idea.</td>', 'Good lighting. Good composition. Great idea.', '2003-12-11 00:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(510319, 49481, 718, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant and flashy.</td>', 'Very vibrant and flashy.', '2003-12-11 00:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
