(510324, 50092, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the crop, and an interesting and simple idea.  But for a photo that''s mostly white, the very soft, OOF pill doesn''t offer enough of a dose.</td>', 'I like the crop, and an interesting and simple idea.  But for a photo that''s mostly white, the very soft, OOF pill doesn''t offer enough of a dose.', '2003-12-11 00:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(510325, 50294, 13354, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Nice colors.</td>', 'Great idea! Nice colors.', '2003-12-11 00:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(510326, 50317, 13354, '<td valign="top">Since this is about the land I would have shown more of it and less sky. Good colors.</td>', 'Since this is about the land I would have shown more of it and less sky. Good colors.', '2003-12-11 00:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(510327, 50113, 13354, '<td valign="top">I like the addition of the red light.</td>', 'I like the addition of the red light.', '2003-12-11 00:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(510329, 50267, 13354, '<td valign="top">Focus doesn''t seem to be exactly where it should be. Good idea. Good colors. I think I would have moved the camera a bit more to the left.</td>', 'Focus doesn''t seem to be exactly where it should be. Good idea. Good colors. I think I would have moved the camera a bit more to the left.', '2003-12-11 00:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(510330, 50227, 13354, '<td valign="top">Good composition. There is a bit of camera shake. Try to use a tripod of make sure the camera is very stable for longer exposures.</td>', 'Good composition. There is a bit of camera shake. Try to use a tripod of make sure the camera is very stable for longer exposures.', '2003-12-11 00:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(510332, 50299, 13354, '<td valign="top">You should have cropped out the light source as it is overexposed and it distracts.</td>', 'You should have cropped out the light source as it is overexposed and it distracts.', '2003-12-11 00:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(510333, 49916, 13354, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pub. Good composition. Good background.</td>', 'Looks like a pub. Good composition. Good background.', '2003-12-11 00:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(510334, 49526, 13354, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Good composition. I''m wondering if it would be even better if a second light on the left of the camera maybe a quarter the strength of the main light or maybe just a reflector to clear up a little bit the darkest area.</td>', 'Good idea. Good composition. I''m wondering if it would be even better if a second light on the left of the camera maybe a quarter the strength of the main light or maybe just a reflector to clear up a little bit the darkest area.', '2003-12-11 00:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(510335, 50050, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot, very simple with good aesthetics.  I think it would be best sharper; some USM would have helped (and I am not a USM obsessed person).  Also, it would be good in the final version to get rid of the dark shadows/dirt in the snow or on the wall, whatever this is.</td>', 'Good shot, very simple with good aesthetics.  I think it would be best sharper; some USM would have helped (and I am not a USM obsessed person).  Also, it would be good in the final version to get rid of the dark shadows/dirt in the snow or on the wall, whatever this is.', '2003-12-11 00:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(510336, 49813, 13354, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF.</td>', 'Good use of DOF.', '2003-12-11 00:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(510337, 50146, 13354, '<td valign="top">Too abstract for me.</td>', 'Too abstract for me.', '2003-12-11 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(510338, 50092, 13354, '<td valign="top">I would have like a bit more contrast or sharper. But this is a good composition and idea.</td>', 'I would have like a bit more contrast or sharper. But this is a good composition and idea.', '2003-12-11 00:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(510340, 49788, 13496, '<td valign="top">I think that this photo would have been more effective sans the power outlet, both aesthetically and for this challenge.  Nice photo -7.</td>', 'I think that this photo would have been more effective sans the power outlet, both aesthetically and for this challenge.  Nice photo -7.', '2003-12-11 01:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(510348, 50077, 259, '<td valign="top">great shot and i think the thick border works well with it too<br/></td>', 'great shot and i think the thick border works well with it too', '2003-12-11 01:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
