(510496, 50255, 5158, '<td valign="top">It might not be the image that fits to simplicity best, but to me it''s for sure one of the strongest images: great composition and strong expression. And I always honour pictures showing people, because those pictures are the hardest to take IMO. Color focus etc. are great too. Good luck.</td>', 'It might not be the image that fits to simplicity best, but to me it''s for sure one of the strongest images: great composition and strong expression. And I always honour pictures showing people, because those pictures are the hardest to take IMO. Color focus etc. are great too. Good luck.', '2003-12-11 06:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
