(510564, 50145, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one does well. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good<br/> <br/>Personal: I like the placement and the tones. You did a good job of making a couple of mundane subjects (bicycle and road) very interesting.<br/> <br/>My vote: 7</td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one does well. Exposure composition focus lighting all very good Personal: I like the placement and the tones. You did a good job of making a couple of mundane subjects (bicycle and road) very interesting. My vote: 7', '2003-12-11 08:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
