(510700, 50077, 7543, '<td valign="top">Superb subject. Like the crop too, and good call on both b/w and the frame (I usually don''t like the frames so thick but this is very tasteful). I give it a 8, but I would give it a 9 if there weren''t a slight oversharpening evident on the foreground tree (you can see it on the lower right side of the tree, the white line). Great job!</td>', 'Superb subject. Like the crop too, and good call on both b/w and the frame (I usually don''t like the frames so thick but this is very tasteful). I give it a 8, but I would give it a 9 if there weren''t a slight oversharpening evident on the foreground tree (you can see it on the lower right side of the tree, the white line). Great job!', '2003-12-11 11:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(510702, 49548, 7543, '<td valign="top">Magnificent job, love it.</td>', 'Magnificent job, love it.', '2003-12-11 11:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(510704, 50326, 12602, '<td valign="top">Good idea but needs better lighting. I would sugest a single light (soft) from above and off to one side. also you have some strange things going on around the knees (motion??) If you don''t have studio flashes try bouncing your flash unit off of the wall/ceiling this will give you a nice soft light without the long exposures. you''re on the right track though, posing is beautiful.</td>', 'Good idea but needs better lighting. I would sugest a single light (soft) from above and off to one side. also you have some strange things going on around the knees (motion??) If you don''t have studio flashes try bouncing your flash unit off of the wall/ceiling this will give you a nice soft light without the long exposures. you''re on the right track though, posing is beautiful.', '2003-12-11 11:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(510706, 50077, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, the dead (?) tree is well in focus and I like the softness of the background. :-) Although I like solid borders a much, this one is too distracting for me: it''s too wide for my taste. Maybe the third would be fine.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, the dead (?) tree is well in focus and I like the softness of the background. :-) Although I like solid borders a much, this one is too distracting for me: it''s too wide for my taste. Maybe the third would be fine.', '2003-12-11 11:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
