(510815, 50273, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, fits the challenge well, of course. Like the subtle reflection. The border, howevver, I feel does not compliment your shot. Maybe if it had a line black line separating the picture from the frame. Dunno, just my opinion.</td>', 'I like this shot, fits the challenge well, of course. Like the subtle reflection. The border, howevver, I feel does not compliment your shot. Maybe if it had a line black line separating the picture from the frame. Dunno, just my opinion.', '2003-12-11 13:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(510816, 49828, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice close up shot. It''s simple, kinda, with not much else going on. The duckie is adorable which always, IMO, helps to adds something to a shot. Good fcous &amp; lighting.</td>', 'this is a really nice close up shot. It''s simple, kinda, with not much else going on. The duckie is adorable which always, IMO, helps to adds something to a shot. Good fcous & lighting.', '2003-12-11 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(510818, 49482, 10858, '<td valign="top">Colours are a bit flat and the photo (your model) could be sharper. Lighting is a bit too harsh on your model''s face and right hand. I guess the horizont is not horizontal because of the chaos here. :-)</td>', 'Colours are a bit flat and the photo (your model) could be sharper. Lighting is a bit too harsh on your model''s face and right hand. I guess the horizont is not horizontal because of the chaos here. :-)', '2003-12-11 14:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(510819, 49850, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot. I wish it were a bit lighter but maybe that would take away from the seamless transition of the sand to the surface of the water. Simple but compelling. Good stuff!</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot. I wish it were a bit lighter but maybe that would take away from the seamless transition of the sand to the surface of the water. Simple but compelling. Good stuff!', '2003-12-11 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(510820, 49751, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice subtle colours.</td>', 'nice subtle colours.', '2003-12-11 14:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(510821, 50156, 12268, '<td valign="top">good idea, the lighting and sharpness could have been better. like that it is bw</td>', 'good idea, the lighting and sharpness could have been better. like that it is bw', '2003-12-11 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(510822, 49855, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice idea but might have been better if it were a fake pearl instead of the earring. Kind takes away from the feeling put across by the title.</td>', 'nice idea but might have been better if it were a fake pearl instead of the earring. Kind takes away from the feeling put across by the title.', '2003-12-11 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
