(511385, 50327, 11155, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Absolutely love the aqua/blue cast of the sky.  The title should maybe relate more to the branches, not the fog.  (I wouldn''t deduct for that!)  Great job.</td>', 'Awesome.  Absolutely love the aqua/blue cast of the sky.  The title should maybe relate more to the branches, not the fog.  (I wouldn''t deduct for that!)  Great job.', '2003-12-12 08:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
