(511390, 50009, 11155, '<td valign="top">Normally I wouldn''t think of a dart on a wall being very interesting to look at, but the gold/black/white colors of this work very well.  I like the placement of the subject (the angle is perfect).  DOF is excellent and really helps draw the eye to the dart tip.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Normally I wouldn''t think of a dart on a wall being very interesting to look at, but the gold/black/white colors of this work very well.  I like the placement of the subject (the angle is perfect).  DOF is excellent and really helps draw the eye to the dart tip.  Nicely done!', '2003-12-12 08:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(511392, 49865, 714, '<td valign="top">You must not be from the US. I''ve never seen cookies like that.  <br/> <br/>I don''t much care for the blue tint in the photo.  Placement of everthing is good, but maybe a different background or just on a table with a plate or something.  Feels to set up.  Nice try. Keep shooting!</td>', 'You must not be from the US. I''ve never seen cookies like that.   I don''t much care for the blue tint in the photo.  Placement of everthing is good, but maybe a different background or just on a table with a plate or something.  Feels to set up.  Nice try. Keep shooting!', '2003-12-12 08:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
