(511713, 50326, 7994, '<td valign="top">i love the composition and the idea of the shot, but the noise is there. still 10 for the good idea</td>', 'i love the composition and the idea of the shot, but the noise is there. still 10 for the good idea', '2003-12-12 19:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(511714, 49548, 7994, '<td valign="top">great shot. seems like you used a glass for this shot. i love the idea 10</td>', 'great shot. seems like you used a glass for this shot. i love the idea 10', '2003-12-12 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(511715, 49597, 7994, '<td valign="top">cute photo</td>', 'cute photo', '2003-12-12 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(511717, 50038, 7994, '<td valign="top">i love the idea</td>', 'i love the idea', '2003-12-12 19:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(511718, 50092, 1078, '<td valign="top">I totally love the idea here.  I was really excited to see it when the thumbnail came up, but I have to admit, this is just too soft for me.  If this were in focus (or even just more in focus) I would be a lot more jazzed about it.</td>', 'I totally love the idea here.  I was really excited to see it when the thumbnail came up, but I have to admit, this is just too soft for me.  If this were in focus (or even just more in focus) I would be a lot more jazzed about it.', '2003-12-12 19:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(511719, 50063, 7994, '<td valign="top">interesting idea</td>', 'interesting idea', '2003-12-12 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(511720, 49611, 7994, '<td valign="top">i love the composition, idea itself is amazing. how did you get the strawberry to stand straight? 10</td>', 'i love the composition, idea itself is amazing. how did you get the strawberry to stand straight? 10', '2003-12-12 19:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(511721, 50198, 7994, '<td valign="top">scary... but a great shot  10</td>', 'scary... but a great shot  10', '2003-12-12 19:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(511723, 50194, 7994, '<td valign="top">i like the idea. the blurr gives the feeling of a whisper. though i''d color it in blueish tones. still 10</td>', 'i like the idea. the blurr gives the feeling of a whisper. though i''d color it in blueish tones. still 10', '2003-12-12 19:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(511724, 50049, 7994, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, nice idea 9</td>', 'beautiful shot, nice idea 9', '2003-12-12 19:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(511725, 49616, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m yet another who doesn''t understand the shot -- it looks like a pair of maple seeds to me.  Beyond that, let me analyze the shot on its own merits.  If you were aiming for abstract (and it could make an interesting abstract, I think), then there''s no reason to keep it so small.  If you were trying to keep the out of focus aspect minimized by keeping it small, then even at this size the focus problems are readily apparent.  There''s simply nothing to tie the viewer to the image, my eyes keep shifting between the three "figures" in the shot -- the dark central figure and the two light spots.  All my opinion, but I think you can probably do a more intriguing version of this -- whatever it may be.</td>', 'I''m yet another who doesn''t understand the shot -- it looks like a pair of maple seeds to me.  Beyond that, let me analyze the shot on its own merits.  If you were aiming for abstract (and it could make an interesting abstract, I think), then there''s no reason to keep it so small.  If you were trying to keep the out of focus aspect minimized by keeping it small, then even at this size the focus problems are readily apparent.  There''s simply nothing to tie the viewer to the image, my eyes keep shifting between the three "figures" in the shot -- the dark central figure and the two light spots.  All my opinion, but I think you can probably do a more intriguing version of this -- whatever it may be.', '2003-12-12 19:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(511726, 50172, 7994, '<td valign="top">good point 10 for idea</td>', 'good point 10 for idea', '2003-12-12 19:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(511727, 49761, 1078, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea you started with, but I have one small aspect that I think complicates this image unnecessarily.  The portion of breast (arm, possibly?) at the upper center portion of the picture takes, for me, enough of the focus away from the belly as to be noticeably distracting.  I like the way the light kind of bleeds the belly into the background -- blurring the line between the two -- by creating such a strong highlight on the skin.  There''s some strong possible metaphors there, at least in my world view.  I also think this would like a lot nicer larger than it currently is -- and I suspect you have a number of people telling you this as well.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like the idea you started with, but I have one small aspect that I think complicates this image unnecessarily.  The portion of breast (arm, possibly?) at the upper center portion of the picture takes, for me, enough of the focus away from the belly as to be noticeably distracting.  I like the way the light kind of bleeds the belly into the background -- blurring the line between the two -- by creating such a strong highlight on the skin.  There''s some strong possible metaphors there, at least in my world view.  I also think this would like a lot nicer larger than it currently is -- and I suspect you have a number of people telling you this as well.  Good luck.', '2003-12-12 19:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(511730, 50172, 1078, '<td valign="top">LOL -- I can think of a couple of ways to tie the image with the quote.  Marriage band?  Or the One Ring?  Yeah, I''m one of the geeks looking forward to the next LOTR installment.  Beyond that, nice composition and coloring.  The ring feels a little off pure horiszontal and that bothers my eye a bit.  (It looks like the ring slants up and to the right just a slight amount -- like the camera wasn''t parallel to the surface the ring was on.)  It may be an optical illusion -- if it is, no worries, if not, you might want to think about a small amount of rotation (clockwise) to the image.  The highlights work well, for me, but the uneven darker areas at the extreme top and bottom edges would be better evened out.  All my opinions of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'LOL -- I can think of a couple of ways to tie the image with the quote.  Marriage band?  Or the One Ring?  Yeah, I''m one of the geeks looking forward to the next LOTR installment.  Beyond that, nice composition and coloring.  The ring feels a little off pure horiszontal and that bothers my eye a bit.  (It looks like the ring slants up and to the right just a slight amount -- like the camera wasn''t parallel to the surface the ring was on.)  It may be an optical illusion -- if it is, no worries, if not, you might want to think about a small amount of rotation (clockwise) to the image.  The highlights work well, for me, but the uneven darker areas at the extreme top and bottom edges would be better evened out.  All my opinions of course.  Good luck.', '2003-12-12 19:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(511732, 50146, 1078, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, interesting abstract.  Don''t understand it in relation to the title -- not that that is entirely necessary.  Personally, I''m struck by the rounder, smoother shapes in the upper right in contrast to the lines and structure in the lower left.  If I had a wish, I''d wish for more strong red in the image -- more of an even rainbow feel across the image.  I suspect this won''t do very well, which is a shame, I think it''s a nice abstract.</td>', 'Hmmm, interesting abstract.  Don''t understand it in relation to the title -- not that that is entirely necessary.  Personally, I''m struck by the rounder, smoother shapes in the upper right in contrast to the lines and structure in the lower left.  If I had a wish, I''d wish for more strong red in the image -- more of an even rainbow feel across the image.  I suspect this won''t do very well, which is a shame, I think it''s a nice abstract.', '2003-12-12 19:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(511734, 49785, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here a lot, but I do wish the numbers could either all be the same tone, or be three different tones.  The 1 stands out too much for my taste.  I keep wanting to see the numerals as ice cubes -- which means, to my mind, you''ve done a good job toning to change one set of objects into another set in the viewer''s eye.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the idea here a lot, but I do wish the numbers could either all be the same tone, or be three different tones.  The 1 stands out too much for my taste.  I keep wanting to see the numerals as ice cubes -- which means, to my mind, you''ve done a good job toning to change one set of objects into another set in the viewer''s eye.  Good luck.', '2003-12-12 19:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(511737, 50329, 1078, '<td valign="top">At first, I wasn''t certain if I liked the skewed glass "table".  However, the more I looked at the image, the more I decided it was a really nice touch that helped break up the symmetry of the piece and give a little more visual stimulation.  Nicely lit and conceived.</td>', 'At first, I wasn''t certain if I liked the skewed glass "table".  However, the more I looked at the image, the more I decided it was a really nice touch that helped break up the symmetry of the piece and give a little more visual stimulation.  Nicely lit and conceived.', '2003-12-12 19:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(511740, 49601, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK -- possibly a monitor problem.  This feels a little bit too subdued in terms of its light and dark values -- or perhaps, it''s not soft enough.  One way or another, for me it lacks a little oomph -- which is a shame because I really like the composition otherwise.  I want that flower to pop off the background -- I think it needs to be lighter than it is.  If you''re worried about it being too bright, you might try a soft focus technique in conjunction with some brighter values.  All just my two cents -- take them for what they''re worth.</td>', 'OK -- possibly a monitor problem.  This feels a little bit too subdued in terms of its light and dark values -- or perhaps, it''s not soft enough.  One way or another, for me it lacks a little oomph -- which is a shame because I really like the composition otherwise.  I want that flower to pop off the background -- I think it needs to be lighter than it is.  If you''re worried about it being too bright, you might try a soft focus technique in conjunction with some brighter values.  All just my two cents -- take them for what they''re worth.', '2003-12-12 19:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(511743, 49779, 1078, '<td valign="top">Well, you got a laugh out of me anyway  :-D</td>', 'Well, you got a laugh out of me anyway  :-D', '2003-12-12 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(511748, 49548, 11241, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot....the only thing that I would change is the bigger water drops are very distracting.....If only they were all small ones.....But very nice a sharp....I give it a 9</td>', 'Really nice shot....the only thing that I would change is the bigger water drops are very distracting.....If only they were all small ones.....But very nice a sharp....I give it a 9', '2003-12-12 20:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(511751, 49779, 11769, '<td valign="top">You made my day.10</td>', 'You made my day.10', '2003-12-12 20:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(511752, 50254, 11769, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge.  Beautiful. 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge.  Beautiful. 10', '2003-12-12 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(511756, 50289, 326, '<td valign="top">COOL SHOT! It kind of hurts my eyes....lol</td>', 'COOL SHOT! It kind of hurts my eyes....lol', '2003-12-12 20:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(511757, 49853, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very nice very simple.....9</td>', 'Very nice very simple.....9', '2003-12-12 20:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(511758, 49512, 326, '<td valign="top">This is nice even with the lens flare..... I like it!</td>', 'This is nice even with the lens flare..... I like it!', '2003-12-12 20:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(511759, 50044, 326, '<td valign="top">Pretty! Love the movement! Good job.</td>', 'Pretty! Love the movement! Good job.', '2003-12-12 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(511763, 49622, 326, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting, Great colors! Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful setting, Great colors! Well done.', '2003-12-12 21:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(511765, 49719, 15015, '<td valign="top">great</td>', 'great', '2003-12-12 21:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(511768, 50295, 14015, '<td valign="top">Nice use of mirroring (including glasses)...</td>', 'Nice use of mirroring (including glasses)...', '2003-12-12 21:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(511769, 50262, 14015, '<td valign="top">I think that if the "levels" in each had been the same, the symmetry would have brought more to the picture...<br/></td>', 'I think that if the "levels" in each had been the same, the symmetry would have brought more to the picture...', '2003-12-12 21:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(511770, 50252, 14015, '<td valign="top">The shadow blocking kitty''s front legs takes away from the detail expressed so well in the puppy''s features.</td>', 'The shadow blocking kitty''s front legs takes away from the detail expressed so well in the puppy''s features.', '2003-12-12 21:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(511771, 50209, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like the color tones and the ''warmth'' of the photo.  Great shot!<br/></td>', 'I like the color tones and the ''warmth'' of the photo.  Great shot!', '2003-12-12 21:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(511773, 49845, 7778, '<td valign="top">While choice of subject is poignantly apt and beautiful and the photo quite decent, IMO, I''d wish for crude surface (a slab of wood or stone?) upon which the bowl be placed. The tangible weight of the object here appears nearly suspended in white space, which disturbs my sense of balance a little.<br/> <br/>I can appreciate the warm diagonal lighting across the image, but would consider the side (on the left) too cold, given the the textural and material properties of the subject.</td>', 'While choice of subject is poignantly apt and beautiful and the photo quite decent, IMO, I''d wish for crude surface (a slab of wood or stone?) upon which the bowl be placed. The tangible weight of the object here appears nearly suspended in white space, which disturbs my sense of balance a little. I can appreciate the warm diagonal lighting across the image, but would consider the side (on the left) too cold, given the the textural and material properties of the subject.', '2003-12-12 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(511774, 50105, 14015, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the photo.  The ''aged'' look and the ''crumples'' in the leaf compliment each other.  Great shot!</td>', 'I love the texture of the photo.  The ''aged'' look and the ''crumples'' in the leaf compliment each other.  Great shot!', '2003-12-12 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(511775, 50172, 14015, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest, the title had an negative impact on my impression of the photo.  Had it been "simply love" or "love everlasting" or something like that, the impact would have been more positive.  <br/> <br/>Not to dwell on the title....I wonder how the shot would have been different had the ring been caught "spinning" in the photo.  Just thinking out loud...<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''ll be honest, the title had an negative impact on my impression of the photo.  Had it been "simply love" or "love everlasting" or something like that, the impact would have been more positive.   Not to dwell on the title....I wonder how the shot would have been different had the ring been caught "spinning" in the photo.  Just thinking out loud... ', '2003-12-12 21:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(511776, 49591, 14015, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective on a simple object to produce a great shot.</td>', 'Nice perspective on a simple object to produce a great shot.', '2003-12-12 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(511777, 49716, 14015, '<td valign="top">Humorous!  =)</td>', 'Humorous!  =)', '2003-12-12 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(511781, 50285, 14015, '<td valign="top">I like the concept - I originally submitted something similar.  However, this feels too busy to me for "Simplicity"...</td>', 'I like the concept - I originally submitted something similar.  However, this feels too busy to me for "Simplicity"...', '2003-12-12 22:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(511782, 49600, 14015, '<td valign="top">Simple. Elegant. Love it!</td>', 'Simple. Elegant. Love it!', '2003-12-12 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(511783, 50277, 14015, '<td valign="top">Excellent color contrast and clarity -- I would love to produce shots like this one!</td>', 'Excellent color contrast and clarity -- I would love to produce shots like this one!', '2003-12-12 22:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(511784, 49875, 14015, '<td valign="top">Would have suggested more leg (emphasizing the ''step'') &amp; less shadow (keeping the color similar across the entire photo)...</td>', 'Would have suggested more leg (emphasizing the ''step'') & less shadow (keeping the color similar across the entire photo)...', '2003-12-12 22:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(511787, 50128, 14015, '<td valign="top">I think you have two great photos in one here.  The cream/red split/contrast OR the solid gray to browns w/ the jagged edge would have been great -- together I feel they distract from one another.  I''m sorry if that was the intention &amp; I didn''t ''get it''...</td>', 'I think you have two great photos in one here.  The cream/red split/contrast OR the solid gray to browns w/ the jagged edge would have been great -- together I feel they distract from one another.  I''m sorry if that was the intention & I didn''t ''get it''...', '2003-12-12 22:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(511788, 50000, 14015, '<td valign="top">Reminicent of ''golden radio'' -- b/w emphasize it.  I also like the shaped corner top-left &amp; the DOF placement of the microphone.  Great shot!</td>', 'Reminicent of ''golden radio'' -- b/w emphasize it.  I also like the shaped corner top-left & the DOF placement of the microphone.  Great shot!', '2003-12-12 22:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(511791, 49900, 14015, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast of the orange would have had more impact if it hadn''t been blocked by the leaves -- specifically on the right side; left side is high enough to appear off the ''stem''...as often seen on juice cartons =)</td>', 'I think the contrast of the orange would have had more impact if it hadn''t been blocked by the leaves -- specifically on the right side; left side is high enough to appear off the ''stem''...as often seen on juice cartons =)', '2003-12-12 22:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(511792, 50201, 14015, '<td valign="top">A bit too busy (I think it''s due to the windows) for "Simplicity" - would have been great to get the statue backdropped by just the blue/cloudy sky?</td>', 'A bit too busy (I think it''s due to the windows) for "Simplicity" - would have been great to get the statue backdropped by just the blue/cloudy sky?', '2003-12-12 22:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(511796, 50296, 14015, '<td valign="top">Probably too nit-picky, but the few leaves distract from the reflectors as being the only ''spots'' near the ''lines'' - removing them might have provided more clarity.</td>', 'Probably too nit-picky, but the few leaves distract from the reflectors as being the only ''spots'' near the ''lines'' - removing them might have provided more clarity.', '2003-12-12 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(511799, 50273, 14015, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I''d like to know what the surface you used for the reflection.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I''d like to know what the surface you used for the reflection.', '2003-12-12 22:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(511813, 50253, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice set up here. I like the differnt colours &amp; the crop. Clean sharp shot. Good stuff</td>', 'nice set up here. I like the differnt colours & the crop. Clean sharp shot. Good stuff', '2003-12-12 22:25:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(511814, 50070, 7778, '<td valign="top">This image strikes me as quite unusual and interesting on almost all conceivable levels, especially with regards to subject and manner. Its numerous and apparent technical flaws (the lack of focus, the strong pixelation, the averted posture of the subject, the blown foreground at bottom) nearly lend themselves to a succesful slap-in-the-face of all we have learnt and hold dear when taking photographs.</td>', 'This image strikes me as quite unusual and interesting on almost all conceivable levels, especially with regards to subject and manner. Its numerous and apparent technical flaws (the lack of focus, the strong pixelation, the averted posture of the subject, the blown foreground at bottom) nearly lend themselves to a succesful slap-in-the-face of all we have learnt and hold dear when taking photographs.', '2003-12-12 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(511815, 50275, 12268, '<td valign="top">technically good shot. Like the composition, nice clean focus</td>', 'technically good shot. Like the composition, nice clean focus', '2003-12-12 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(511817, 50036, 12268, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused, sharp shot. Overly simple but thats what its supposed to be. Good shot.</td>', 'Nicely focused, sharp shot. Overly simple but thats what its supposed to be. Good shot.', '2003-12-12 22:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(511818, 50317, 12268, '<td valign="top">clean shot, nice focus, cool sublte colours. Good stuff</td>', 'clean shot, nice focus, cool sublte colours. Good stuff', '2003-12-12 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(511822, 50214, 12268, '<td valign="top">this is a great object for this challenge</td>', 'this is a great object for this challenge', '2003-12-12 22:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(511823, 50183, 12268, '<td valign="top">interesting! best of the bottle top shots!</td>', 'interesting! best of the bottle top shots!', '2003-12-12 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(511824, 49788, 12268, '<td valign="top">This is anice shot. Focus seems like it could be better. Hard to tell if you were going fro the soft focus look. Also, I would have cropped out the outlets, a bit distracting.</td>', 'This is anice shot. Focus seems like it could be better. Hard to tell if you were going fro the soft focus look. Also, I would have cropped out the outlets, a bit distracting.', '2003-12-12 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(511825, 49541, 12253, '<td valign="top">Neat idea; love the color contrasts.  I think it would be more dynamic without the curve at the top; really emphasizes the perspective and colors there, and ... much simpler!</td>', 'Neat idea; love the color contrasts.  I think it would be more dynamic without the curve at the top; really emphasizes the perspective and colors there, and ... much simpler!', '2003-12-12 22:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(511826, 49641, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture and light; the shadows could be improvedwith a bit more detail (e.g., the front of the lower right rock).</td>', 'Very nice texture and light; the shadows could be improvedwith a bit more detail (e.g., the front of the lower right rock).', '2003-12-12 22:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(511828, 50077, 12253, '<td valign="top">Love the foreground tree and crop.  Would have liked this to be bigger; some oversharpening evident especially in the back trees (halos).</td>', 'Love the foreground tree and crop.  Would have liked this to be bigger; some oversharpening evident especially in the back trees (halos).', '2003-12-12 22:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(511829, 50313, 12253, '<td valign="top">The light and tones are wonderful here.  Very painterly.  The composition works, but I find the greenery on the far left somewhat distracting and not as lush as the center stem and flower.  That plus the right lean of the flower, and I would have been tempted to crop and put the flower in the left third.  Overall, very nice.</td>', 'The light and tones are wonderful here.  Very painterly.  The composition works, but I find the greenery on the far left somewhat distracting and not as lush as the center stem and flower.  That plus the right lean of the flower, and I would have been tempted to crop and put the flower in the left third.  Overall, very nice.', '2003-12-12 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(511830, 50034, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and very good composition.  I think the yellow part of the flower works so well, I find the redish center "distracting".  I''d be interested to see how this looked with the red removed.</td>', 'Wonderful texture and very good composition.  I think the yellow part of the flower works so well, I find the redish center "distracting".  I''d be interested to see how this looked with the red removed.', '2003-12-12 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(511831, 50128, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract of the wall.   In 20 years it will be even more interesting!</td>', 'Wonderful abstract of the wall.   In 20 years it will be even more interesting!', '2003-12-12 22:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(511834, 50295, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  A good simple shot but I think it could have been more interesting compositionally.  The background is a bit distracting, and I think for this shot you could have cropped the video camera on several sides to make it more dynamic and less a "product" looking shot.  Good imagination!</td>', 'Very clever!  A good simple shot but I think it could have been more interesting compositionally.  The background is a bit distracting, and I think for this shot you could have cropped the video camera on several sides to make it more dynamic and less a "product" looking shot.  Good imagination!', '2003-12-12 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(511837, 50074, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very simple, and very colorful.  Good composition.</td>', 'Very simple, and very colorful.  Good composition.', '2003-12-12 22:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(511845, 49853, 13136, '<td valign="top">This is the only White-on-White picture in the challenge that works WELL! Great shot.</td>', 'This is the only White-on-White picture in the challenge that works WELL! Great shot.', '2003-12-12 23:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(511846, 49611, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Is it upside down? I''m tempted to give it an extra point just to help offset some offended low vote this is sure to get.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Is it upside down? I''m tempted to give it an extra point just to help offset some offended low vote this is sure to get.', '2003-12-12 23:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(511847, 49918, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cute kid. Good composition and color. Great shot.</td>', 'Cute kid. Good composition and color. Great shot.', '2003-12-12 23:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(511848, 50289, 12268, '<td valign="top">I like the object but the BG is a bit dizzy</td>', 'I like the object but the BG is a bit dizzy', '2003-12-12 23:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(511852, 50231, 4767, '<td valign="top">GOOD color balancing act.  (also well balanced composition!)</td>', 'GOOD color balancing act.  (also well balanced composition!)', '2003-12-12 23:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(511854, 49850, 4767, '<td valign="top">well done!</td>', 'well done!', '2003-12-12 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
