(511957, 49600, 5158, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well composed. Only a little too bright for me and could be also sharper too.</td>', 'Good idea and well composed. Only a little too bright for me and could be also sharper too.', '2003-12-13 05:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(511958, 50294, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the color, the structure and the graininess. I would have liked it to see a little more, so that even without the title one could realize what it is. Good luck</td>', 'I like the color, the structure and the graininess. I would have liked it to see a little more, so that even without the title one could realize what it is. Good luck', '2003-12-13 05:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(511962, 49792, 5158, '<td valign="top">The connection between Armish-people and simplicity is very straight foreward and thus well choosen. The image itself however is somewhat crowded: one carrige might have been better. Also pure B&amp;W might have been a better choice, because the blue dress attracts the attention of the viewer first, but the dress isn''t of interest, or is blue a special armish color? Also, what happend to the head of the wommen, looks like being cut off.</td>', 'The connection between Armish-people and simplicity is very straight foreward and thus well choosen. The image itself however is somewhat crowded: one carrige might have been better. Also pure B&W might have been a better choice, because the blue dress attracts the attention of the viewer first, but the dress isn''t of interest, or is blue a special armish color? Also, what happend to the head of the wommen, looks like being cut off.', '2003-12-13 05:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(511963, 49918, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wooonderfull! My this weeks favourite! I like the colors, the composition and the pose of the novice. And to me it fits the challenge very well although some people might say that it is not simple in an abstract way, but to me simplicity also means reduction to the essentials and that is shown here very well. Hope you win!</td>', 'Wooonderfull! My this weeks favourite! I like the colors, the composition and the pose of the novice. And to me it fits the challenge very well although some people might say that it is not simple in an abstract way, but to me simplicity also means reduction to the essentials and that is shown here very well. Hope you win!', '2003-12-13 05:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(511964, 50223, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like yours very much: clear structures, clear colour, clear composition but not boring at all. I took a while until I got how to turn the image to understand how the roof is build up. Good luck to you.</td>', 'I like yours very much: clear structures, clear colour, clear composition but not boring at all. I took a while until I got how to turn the image to understand how the roof is build up. Good luck to you.', '2003-12-13 05:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(511965, 49788, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like the colour, composition with the door and the plugs as well as the pose of the guy. Technically it looks a little of focus, but maybe that''s intended. <br/>I do have a problem to see the challenge topic in it: to me feeling blue is a rather complex thing with many negative thoughts running through ones head.</td>', 'I like the colour, composition with the door and the plugs as well as the pose of the guy. Technically it looks a little of focus, but maybe that''s intended. I do have a problem to see the challenge topic in it: to me feeling blue is a rather complex thing with many negative thoughts running through ones head.', '2003-12-13 06:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(511981, 50049, 5158, '<td valign="top">Compared to the other sunset images this one is very special: using macro, the non-spherical sunf the unsharp black forground and  the color-variation are great. What disturbes is that only one branch is sharp and the right one not. Acctually one branch shoud have been enough. In that case it would have fit even better to the challenge topic. Still, I give it a 7.</td>', 'Compared to the other sunset images this one is very special: using macro, the non-spherical sunf the unsharp black forground and  the color-variation are great. What disturbes is that only one branch is sharp and the right one not. Acctually one branch shoud have been enough. In that case it would have fit even better to the challenge topic. Still, I give it a 7.', '2003-12-13 07:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(511994, 50299, 10799, '<td valign="top">The light is much too bright for me although it seems to me as if you did it on purpose.  They don''t look too happy.</td>', 'The light is much too bright for me although it seems to me as if you did it on purpose.  They don''t look too happy.', '2003-12-13 08:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
