(512077, 50223, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very good. I like the idea. One thing, because the roof is a much stronger element than the blue sky, I may have had less of it in the shot. I realize that would keep you from having the perfect angle with the red edge. But it might make for a stronger image. 9</td>', 'Very good. I like the idea. One thing, because the roof is a much stronger element than the blue sky, I may have had less of it in the shot. I realize that would keep you from having the perfect angle with the red edge. But it might make for a stronger image. 9', '2003-12-13 11:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
