(512562, 50229, 12428, '<td valign="top">colours seemed very washed out.... increasing the contrast will help alot. In my opinion, there are also alot of distraction around the art piece u are trying to put into the limelight. Perhaps, closing in towards the artpiece and hence throwing the trees, lamp post etc out of the frame will help viewer focus more. Cheers.</td>', 'colours seemed very washed out.... increasing the contrast will help alot. In my opinion, there are also alot of distraction around the art piece u are trying to put into the limelight. Perhaps, closing in towards the artpiece and hence throwing the trees, lamp post etc out of the frame will help viewer focus more. Cheers.', '2003-12-14 04:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
