(512588, 49611, 8891, '<td valign="top">come on now....simple is the berry or the gland alone, you''ve thoroughly complicated it by with this berry tit balancing act....great shot for a balance theme but simple?  nice shot....just no simple enough.</td>', 'come on now....simple is the berry or the gland alone, you''ve thoroughly complicated it by with this berry tit balancing act....great shot for a balance theme but simple?  nice shot....just no simple enough.', '2003-12-14 07:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(512589, 50125, 8891, '<td valign="top">really needed a slight CW rotation...nice shot, lighting, reflections, set up....lose the frame....it confines the space.</td>', 'really needed a slight CW rotation...nice shot, lighting, reflections, set up....lose the frame....it confines the space.', '2003-12-14 07:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(512592, 49813, 11440, '<td valign="top">two in one :)</td>', 'two in one :)', '2003-12-14 08:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(512597, 50035, 11440, '<td valign="top">good idea</td>', 'good idea', '2003-12-14 08:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(512599, 50191, 11440, '<td valign="top">There''s a picture of a cat in every challenge...</td>', 'There''s a picture of a cat in every challenge...', '2003-12-14 08:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(512618, 50067, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good simple "pop-art" composition, well done overall.  I think it might have been better with an evenly exposed white mesh placemat rather than the overexposure there (I presume this is intentional to give the photo some extra dynamics).  As I look at it longer, it might have also been good to experiment with different spoons to try to make the spoon more "attractive" (not detailed, but perhaps a little longer out of the soup than it is, or extra wide handle, or some more geometric shape without fancy detail.  Our spoons are more shapely ;)<br/> <br/>Overall, nice work.</td>', 'A good simple "pop-art" composition, well done overall.  I think it might have been better with an evenly exposed white mesh placemat rather than the overexposure there (I presume this is intentional to give the photo some extra dynamics).  As I look at it longer, it might have also been good to experiment with different spoons to try to make the spoon more "attractive" (not detailed, but perhaps a little longer out of the soup than it is, or extra wide handle, or some more geometric shape without fancy detail.  Our spoons are more shapely ;) Overall, nice work.', '2003-12-14 09:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(512619, 49859, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve placed this on the table and used the patterns of the table to give this an geometric design, though in general centered compositions are a bit weaker, and the pattern here is perhaps not strong enough to make this work as pop-art does, or as an abstract.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve placed this on the table and used the patterns of the table to give this an geometric design, though in general centered compositions are a bit weaker, and the pattern here is perhaps not strong enough to make this work as pop-art does, or as an abstract.', '2003-12-14 09:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(512621, 50056, 12253, '<td valign="top">A very simple shot, using the rule of thirds.  However, since there''s so few elements here, and so little form in the frame, I think it might have worked better without using a sillouette approach (that would of course, depend on how the wood actually looked!).  Or maybe just not quite so dark, so we could see some of it''s texture and detail.</td>', 'A very simple shot, using the rule of thirds.  However, since there''s so few elements here, and so little form in the frame, I think it might have worked better without using a sillouette approach (that would of course, depend on how the wood actually looked!).  Or maybe just not quite so dark, so we could see some of it''s texture and detail.', '2003-12-14 09:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(512622, 49824, 12253, '<td valign="top">Can''t get much simpler than this.  Good job overall, but if you forgive the pun, the base of the nail is not "tack sharp", and I think it should be here.  (Also, the line in the background competes.)</td>', 'Can''t get much simpler than this.  Good job overall, but if you forgive the pun, the base of the nail is not "tack sharp", and I think it should be here.  (Also, the line in the background competes.)', '2003-12-14 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(512623, 50064, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot.  Good twist to have it in air, but it''s less dynamic than it could have been if a bit further up.  While you did a very good job on this meeting the challenge, with some flare, I don''t think it''s as interesting a subject as many have found here.  (Though this is one of the better nail theme shots in the challenge!)</td>', 'Nice clear shot.  Good twist to have it in air, but it''s less dynamic than it could have been if a bit further up.  While you did a very good job on this meeting the challenge, with some flare, I don''t think it''s as interesting a subject as many have found here.  (Though this is one of the better nail theme shots in the challenge!)', '2003-12-14 09:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(512624, 50209, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think this is more interesting than many of the nail shots we see here in the challenge.  I do have a few technical issues though: IThe lack of clarity of the light and shadows on the wall detracts from this as an abstract or geometric design.  The perspective shift of the radiator suggests that this could have been made even more interesting by shooting it from a more pronounced angle, say the floor.  Maybe even tilting the camera.  A large depth of field should have been able to capture the shadows in focus as well.</td>', 'I think this is more interesting than many of the nail shots we see here in the challenge.  I do have a few technical issues though: IThe lack of clarity of the light and shadows on the wall detracts from this as an abstract or geometric design.  The perspective shift of the radiator suggests that this could have been made even more interesting by shooting it from a more pronounced angle, say the floor.  Maybe even tilting the camera.  A large depth of field should have been able to capture the shadows in focus as well.', '2003-12-14 09:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(512625, 49911, 10673, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  10</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  10', '2003-12-14 09:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(512626, 50257, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good abstract and shot.  Two comments from a viewers perspective: 1)  the white spots don''t fit the pattern nor blend well with the lovely textures of the wood.   2) I would have liked to see the wood grain better.  Maybe via a different contrast/toning adjustment, or maybe by having the natural colors show.</td>', 'A good abstract and shot.  Two comments from a viewers perspective: 1)  the white spots don''t fit the pattern nor blend well with the lovely textures of the wood.   2) I would have liked to see the wood grain better.  Maybe via a different contrast/toning adjustment, or maybe by having the natural colors show.', '2003-12-14 09:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(512627, 50327, 10673, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured!  10</td>', 'Beautifully captured!  10', '2003-12-14 09:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(512628, 50152, 8666, '<td valign="top">Great shadow and reflecitons although I would have liked to see the whole plate</td>', 'Great shadow and reflecitons although I would have liked to see the whole plate', '2003-12-14 09:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(512629, 50266, 12253, '<td valign="top">Simple on two planes.  A good arrangement too.  I think you should have tried to postprocess with neatimage or other two get rid of the "aging" on the surface of the letters.  That plus the slight reflections make them look less apealing and detract from the shot.</td>', 'Simple on two planes.  A good arrangement too.  I think you should have tried to postprocess with neatimage or other two get rid of the "aging" on the surface of the letters.  That plus the slight reflections make them look less apealing and detract from the shot.', '2003-12-14 09:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(512632, 49611, 8666, '<td valign="top">Funny. Sharp and good colors.</td>', 'Funny. Sharp and good colors.', '2003-12-14 10:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(512633, 50044, 10673, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  10</td>', 'Lovely!  10', '2003-12-14 10:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(512634, 50208, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good capture of the moon, simple shot too.  I find the composition/crop here not very dynamic.  Too close to the edge perhaps or too much dead space.  I think you might keep it in the left or top third, and crop a bit tighter.</td>', 'A good capture of the moon, simple shot too.  I find the composition/crop here not very dynamic.  Too close to the edge perhaps or too much dead space.  I think you might keep it in the left or top third, and crop a bit tighter.', '2003-12-14 10:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(512637, 50102, 8666, '<td valign="top">There is nothing simple about this picture, the reflections, the colors. I would rated it higher in another challange. 6.</td>', 'There is nothing simple about this picture, the reflections, the colors. I would rated it higher in another challange. 6.', '2003-12-14 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
