(512673, 50140, 10799, '<td valign="top">I don''t seem to get the essence of simplicity through the mirror scratches and glare.  It almost makes this shoot too complicated to focus on the man.  It might have been better to just have the shot of the man walking down the hall and not the reflection.  I think it would make this shot simpler and more pleasing.</td>', 'I don''t seem to get the essence of simplicity through the mirror scratches and glare.  It almost makes this shoot too complicated to focus on the man.  It might have been better to just have the shot of the man walking down the hall and not the reflection.  I think it would make this shot simpler and more pleasing.', '2003-12-14 10:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(512674, 50234, 10799, '<td valign="top">to me the bee is just right but the yellow  flowers have to much glare on them.... they seem awfully bright <br/> <br/>Maybe a tighter crop would have eliminated the worst of the glare.</td>', 'to me the bee is just right but the yellow  flowers have to much glare on them.... they seem awfully bright  Maybe a tighter crop would have eliminated the worst of the glare.', '2003-12-14 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
