(513062, 50239, 7778, '<td valign="top">Journalism par excellence!<br/> <br/>I''ve given 6/271 entries in this challenge above average marks. This is my highest rated entry. <br/> <br/>The dry objective manner (b and w, large depth of field, the unselective lighting etc.) of this poignant capture make both a stark social statement and a deeply moving photo. The (apparent) refusal of the photographer to embellish even parts or aspects of this image result in bared nerves, at least, on part of this viewer.<br/> <br/>The essence and spirit of this -record- leave neither margin nor doubt: meaning is that which is. <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Journalism par excellence! I''ve given 6/271 entries in this challenge above average marks. This is my highest rated entry.  The dry objective manner (b and w, large depth of field, the unselective lighting etc.) of this poignant capture make both a stark social statement and a deeply moving photo. The (apparent) refusal of the photographer to embellish even parts or aspects of this image result in bared nerves, at least, on part of this viewer. The essence and spirit of this -record- leave neither margin nor doubt: meaning is that which is.     ', '2003-12-14 21:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(513114, 49975, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the color scheme here very much, but would prefer not to see the reflection of the lights in the vase.</td>', 'Love the color scheme here very much, but would prefer not to see the reflection of the lights in the vase.', '2003-12-14 22:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(513149, 50211, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the color scheme as well as the stark landscape...just wish the contrast wasn''t so high as detail is lost in the snow.</td>', 'I love the color scheme as well as the stark landscape...just wish the contrast wasn''t so high as detail is lost in the snow.', '2003-12-14 22:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(513170, 50253, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like this very much, good composition and great colors, lighting and detail.  A small nit....could have least cleaned the mallet head....IT''S FIlthy!!!LOL!  10 anyway.</td>', 'Like this very much, good composition and great colors, lighting and detail.  A small nit....could have least cleaned the mallet head....IT''S FIlthy!!!LOL!  10 anyway.', '2003-12-14 22:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(513174, 50221, 8891, '<td valign="top">jeez you know the moon is in the vastness of the heavens so I really do not understand the necessity of this tight crop.  Photo quality is very good.</td>', 'jeez you know the moon is in the vastness of the heavens so I really do not understand the necessity of this tight crop.  Photo quality is very good.', '2003-12-14 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(513179, 50015, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but let me pass on some fond words of advice that I received in this challange....did you have to cut of the branch in the upper left corner....it weakens the composition for me.  Now it also looks from the angle you chose that you tried to hide the shadow.  The shadow should have been more accentuated by having the subject away from the background and another angle chosen preferably from above for my tastes, but below or left or right might have worked as well.  If you did not want the shadow,  you might have gone with black in the BG and the subject would have stood out more.  Know as it appears, the suject seems connected to the BG.</td>', 'I like the idea of this but let me pass on some fond words of advice that I received in this challange....did you have to cut of the branch in the upper left corner....it weakens the composition for me.  Now it also looks from the angle you chose that you tried to hide the shadow.  The shadow should have been more accentuated by having the subject away from the background and another angle chosen preferably from above for my tastes, but below or left or right might have worked as well.  If you did not want the shadow,  you might have gone with black in the BG and the subject would have stood out more.  Know as it appears, the suject seems connected to the BG.', '2003-12-14 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(513186, 49893, 8891, '<td valign="top">super, excellent detail, (bad manicure, LOL!) and lighting.  The background is really blah.  it is plain and simple but since it is not the subject, it does not necessarily have to be as well. Composition is fair but I wouold have maybe found a plant the did more of a diagonal bend to onc side ot the other and was a bit longer and shot the fingers to the opposite corne of the top of the plant. even as is move the fingers to my right would have helpe a bit.  Very nice regardless.</td>', 'super, excellent detail, (bad manicure, LOL!) and lighting.  The background is really blah.  it is plain and simple but since it is not the subject, it does not necessarily have to be as well. Composition is fair but I wouold have maybe found a plant the did more of a diagonal bend to onc side ot the other and was a bit longer and shot the fingers to the opposite corne of the top of the plant. even as is move the fingers to my right would have helpe a bit.  Very nice regardless.', '2003-12-14 22:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(513188, 50270, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice composition....the suject is bit to dark gray in tonality...don''t know what it is or the process of the BW or if it was shot or not in BW....just too much dark gray and gray and black and no white.</td>', 'nice composition....the suject is bit to dark gray in tonality...don''t know what it is or the process of the BW or if it was shot or not in BW....just too much dark gray and gray and black and no white.', '2003-12-14 23:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(513191, 50287, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is very nice, but I wish there was more room between the ornament and the bottom border, and I find the bright bulb on the right to be  too distracting.  I love the gold color but wish the green of the tree was more prominent to balance it out and I also wish the ornament was let with some fill light.  Good DOF too</td>', 'Composition is very nice, but I wish there was more room between the ornament and the bottom border, and I find the bright bulb on the right to be  too distracting.  I love the gold color but wish the green of the tree was more prominent to balance it out and I also wish the ornament was let with some fill light.  Good DOF too', '2003-12-14 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(513198, 50250, 8891, '<td valign="top">Well here''s another one of those, I guess, DA''s in the camera.  Nice I guess but I do not know if the painterly effect is what I would have used to take a picture of a subject in a challenge whose theme is simplicity.</td>', 'Well here''s another one of those, I guess, DA''s in the camera.  Nice I guess but I do not know if the painterly effect is what I would have used to take a picture of a subject in a challenge whose theme is simplicity.', '2003-12-14 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(513200, 49840, 8891, '<td valign="top">I see, I think, that you maybe ha dto shoot this under low light and that perhaps chose a higher aperture? Well maybe not, but the DOF is just to much in focus and really distracts from the subject.</td>', 'I see, I think, that you maybe ha dto shoot this under low light and that perhaps chose a higher aperture? Well maybe not, but the DOF is just to much in focus and really distracts from the subject.', '2003-12-14 23:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(513201, 50049, 8891, '<td valign="top">well almost. The detail of the seeds, the lighting and the colors in this are exquisite but what is that lump of yellow in the middle? The sun....why is it so mis-shapened.  I would have avoided it. I still would have gotten the message about the day ending and the title would not need to be changed.</td>', 'well almost. The detail of the seeds, the lighting and the colors in this are exquisite but what is that lump of yellow in the middle? The sun....why is it so mis-shapened.  I would have avoided it. I still would have gotten the message about the day ending and the title would not need to be changed.', '2003-12-14 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(513202, 50308, 8891, '<td valign="top">just does not look focused to me and the composition is not good.</td>', 'just does not look focused to me and the composition is not good.', '2003-12-14 23:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(513203, 50080, 8891, '<td valign="top">this would have worked a lot better if  the subject leaf was entirely by itself. the canna leaves and their colors are really distracting.</td>', 'this would have worked a lot better if  the subject leaf was entirely by itself. the canna leaves and their colors are really distracting.', '2003-12-14 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(513204, 50063, 8891, '<td valign="top">now what is this US? The composition is quite fine but I would have not cropped this so tight around the upper right of the line of coins. the back ground complements the cooper coin color somewhat but I would have chosen something a few shades darker.  It works well with the lead coin but not those further back.</td>', 'now what is this US? The composition is quite fine but I would have not cropped this so tight around the upper right of the line of coins. the back ground complements the cooper coin color somewhat but I would have chosen something a few shades darker.  It works well with the lead coin but not those further back.', '2003-12-14 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(513207, 50194, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nudity. Nudity is an acceptable form of art on this site. Photographs may not, however, show a penis or a vagina.....OK now on to the technical problems...TOOO soft.and the colors of the background blend to much to the subject. And is there a point to so small an image.</td>', 'Nudity. Nudity is an acceptable form of art on this site. Photographs may not, however, show a penis or a vagina.....OK now on to the technical problems...TOOO soft.and the colors of the background blend to much to the subject. And is there a point to so small an image.', '2003-12-14 23:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(513209, 49583, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great product shot and the stuff IS easy to make....tastes like blender cheese...it would have gotten a 10 from me but for the difference in the pasta from the box to the forground....couldn''t you find any macaroni and not used the shells?</td>', 'Great product shot and the stuff IS easy to make....tastes like blender cheese...it would have gotten a 10 from me but for the difference in the pasta from the box to the forground....couldn''t you find any macaroni and not used the shells?', '2003-12-14 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(513217, 50064, 8891, '<td valign="top">OK....i''ll try to forgive the spots to the right of the subject and the possible abrasions under it as well...was shot as dropped or is there some physics going on behind the seen....if dropped its a nice capture and if physics the effect is very good. Excellent except for the aforementioned items.</td>', 'OK....i''ll try to forgive the spots to the right of the subject and the possible abrasions under it as well...was shot as dropped or is there some physics going on behind the seen....if dropped its a nice capture and if physics the effect is very good. Excellent except for the aforementioned items.', '2003-12-14 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
