(514283, 50077, 8682, '<td valign="top">Just an amazing shot! I love it. One of the best shot of this week. I love the B&amp;W choice in this picture. I think the mist is helping you in this picture. No doubt, awesome picture. So, congrats for a fantastic work. Keep the good work. 10</td>', 'Just an amazing shot! I love it. One of the best shot of this week. I love the B&W choice in this picture. I think the mist is helping you in this picture. No doubt, awesome picture. So, congrats for a fantastic work. Keep the good work. 10', '2003-12-16 06:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(514284, 49873, 8682, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow... What an amazing shot. I love it... 10</td>', 'Wow, wow, wow... What an amazing shot. I love it... 10', '2003-12-16 06:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(514285, 50092, 13759, '<td valign="top">Why people are seeing simplicity as out of focus, bad taken photography? It will be very interesting if is in focus.</td>', 'Why people are seeing simplicity as out of focus, bad taken photography? It will be very interesting if is in focus.', '2003-12-16 06:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(514286, 49669, 13759, '<td valign="top">The shoes were a good idea. I personally think that two shoes are more than necesary. Only one will be ok to me. But was a good shot.</td>', 'The shoes were a good idea. I personally think that two shoes are more than necesary. Only one will be ok to me. But was a good shot.', '2003-12-16 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(514287, 50214, 13759, '<td valign="top">I like it , seems to be a perfect theme. I don´t like of the darker area on top of the photo.  It adds a new level of details that is incompatible with my concept of simplicity. Overall, a good performance.</td>', 'I like it , seems to be a perfect theme. I don´t like of the darker area on top of the photo.  It adds a new level of details that is incompatible with my concept of simplicity. Overall, a good performance.', '2003-12-16 06:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(514290, 49997, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful &amp; Simple shot. It meets the challenge, and I think it´s a good and interesting picture. I like the form that you photographed a common subject. 7</td>', 'Beatiful & Simple shot. It meets the challenge, and I think it´s a good and interesting picture. I like the form that you photographed a common subject. 7', '2003-12-16 06:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(514293, 49583, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s a good still life. The still life concept otherwise is not the same of simplicity. Still life requires a detailed e very worked scene. Simplicity to me is a natural look of the form in the essence of it. No carefully setup of the scene.</td>', 'It´s a good still life. The still life concept otherwise is not the same of simplicity. Still life requires a detailed e very worked scene. Simplicity to me is a natural look of the form in the essence of it. No carefully setup of the scene.', '2003-12-16 06:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(514294, 49612, 13759, '<td valign="top">I like this duck. It´s a simple duck? In this challenge the concept of simplicity is used as nany diferent way as possible. I really like the subject, but dislike of  the absent of photographic issues, like exposition, lit and others. It seems to be a simple snapshot. Is this your concept of simplicity? I think that the subject simplicity matters, no photographic equipment and techniques, simplicity of use.</td>', 'I like this duck. It´s a simple duck? In this challenge the concept of simplicity is used as nany diferent way as possible. I really like the subject, but dislike of  the absent of photographic issues, like exposition, lit and others. It seems to be a simple snapshot. Is this your concept of simplicity? I think that the subject simplicity matters, no photographic equipment and techniques, simplicity of use.', '2003-12-16 06:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(514295, 49930, 13759, '<td valign="top">Finally someone that undestand simplicity issues. I like of your theme, but I think your angle, lit and backgound can be improved.</td>', 'Finally someone that undestand simplicity issues. I like of your theme, but I think your angle, lit and backgound can be improved.', '2003-12-16 06:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(514297, 49736, 13759, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and full of meaning to us of DPC! :)</td>', 'Very nice, and full of meaning to us of DPC! :)', '2003-12-16 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(514298, 50332, 13759, '<td valign="top">The simple use of the shadow, makes it a bit more complex.</td>', 'The simple use of the shadow, makes it a bit more complex.', '2003-12-16 07:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(514300, 49549, 13759, '<td valign="top">Too complex to me! I can´t recognize any tipe of form, thats the general aspect of simplicity meaning to me. Sorry. :(</td>', 'Too complex to me! I can´t recognize any tipe of form, thats the general aspect of simplicity meaning to me. Sorry. :(', '2003-12-16 07:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(514301, 49812, 13759, '<td valign="top">How many people took sand´s shots. They think that this complex patern of winds playing are simple subject. Sorry, but I can´t see it like you. To me it is very complex.</td>', 'How many people took sand´s shots. They think that this complex patern of winds playing are simple subject. Sorry, but I can´t see it like you. To me it is very complex.', '2003-12-16 07:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(514303, 49611, 13759, '<td valign="top">Another still life. Very well done, but I thought that still life is a detailed, precisely arrange of elements that is not simple in the essence.</td>', 'Another still life. Very well done, but I thought that still life is a detailed, precisely arrange of elements that is not simple in the essence.', '2003-12-16 07:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(514305, 50233, 8891, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of the negative DOF for the most part....I think here if you are trying to convey that we do not appreciate our freedoms  and the BG is not something that  some might not consider appreciable, that you might have gone the other way.</td>', 'I am a fan of the negative DOF for the most part....I think here if you are trying to convey that we do not appreciate our freedoms  and the BG is not something that  some might not consider appreciable, that you might have gone the other way.', '2003-12-16 07:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(514306, 49855, 13759, '<td valign="top">Hummm, another still life! I thought that a precise, detailed, lighted and arranged set of elements can´t represent simplicity. The set, itself mean a couple not a simple object at all.</td>', 'Hummm, another still life! I thought that a precise, detailed, lighted and arranged set of elements can´t represent simplicity. The set, itself mean a couple not a simple object at all.', '2003-12-16 07:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(514308, 50255, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice portraits...i do not understand the message you are trying to convey with regards to the challenge theme.</td>', 'nice portraits...i do not understand the message you are trying to convey with regards to the challenge theme.', '2003-12-16 07:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514309, 50111, 8891, '<td valign="top">simple is one red rose on a plain background and not a dozen with all that baby''s breath.</td>', 'simple is one red rose on a plain background and not a dozen with all that baby''s breath.', '2003-12-16 07:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
