(514392, 49779, 3185, '<td valign="top">I definitely understand the sediment of this photo. I could not live without my dishwasher. However, I think this photo is very dark for the image you are trying to portray. This photo makes me think that the man is longing for his lost lover. Did the dish washer die? I think brightening up the image would brighten up the tone of the pic.</td>', 'I definitely understand the sediment of this photo. I could not live without my dishwasher. However, I think this photo is very dark for the image you are trying to portray. This photo makes me think that the man is longing for his lost lover. Did the dish washer die? I think brightening up the image would brighten up the tone of the pic.', '2003-12-16 09:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(514393, 50063, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better with a deeper DoF</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better with a deeper DoF', '2003-12-16 09:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(514394, 50049, 8682, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, amazing shot. I love the colours of the background. Perhaps, the sun is distracting a bit. But, it´s a fantastic shot. 7</td>', 'Wow, wow, amazing shot. I love the colours of the background. Perhaps, the sun is distracting a bit. But, it´s a fantastic shot. 7', '2003-12-16 09:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
