(514398, 50231, 3185, '<td valign="top">I really like the symmetry of this photo. The angle also gives it an almost abstract quality. Good job!</td>', 'I really like the symmetry of this photo. The angle also gives it an almost abstract quality. Good job!', '2003-12-16 09:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(514400, 50316, 3185, '<td valign="top">I think that you did a good job still showing the white cup on the white background. This is a very simple photo and fits the topic perfectly.</td>', 'I think that you did a good job still showing the white cup on the white background. This is a very simple photo and fits the topic perfectly.', '2003-12-16 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
