(514719, 49774, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. I feel this one does well. Exposure composition focus lighting all good- the background light is interesting but borderline distracting to me.<br/> <br/>Personal: For me this really works well for simplicity. I like the not-so-traditional placement and the angle of the shot.<br/> <br/>My vote: 6<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. I feel this one does well. Exposure composition focus lighting all good- the background light is interesting but borderline distracting to me. Personal: For me this really works well for simplicity. I like the not-so-traditional placement and the angle of the shot. My vote: 6', '2003-12-16 17:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(514720, 49504, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one does. Exposure seems a tad too dark. Is that snow? I really like the composition. Focus is way too soft for me- I assume you''re trying to acheive an effect, but for me it fails. I really like the lighting, as if the glove is spotlighted.<br/> <br/>Personal:This has a great deal of potential to me, but the lack of focus really hurts it.<br/> <br/>My vote: 4<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one does. Exposure seems a tad too dark. Is that snow? I really like the composition. Focus is way too soft for me- I assume you''re trying to acheive an effect, but for me it fails. I really like the lighting, as if the glove is spotlighted. Personal:This has a great deal of potential to me, but the lack of focus really hurts it. My vote: 4', '2003-12-16 17:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(514724, 49541, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge, but this one doesn''t say simplicity to me very loudly. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, the combination of the DOF, perspective and lighting all give it a certain "look" that is very interesting and almost rock video-ish.<br/> <br/>Personal: I like the shot, but I don''t identify it with the challenge theme.<br/> <br/>My vote: 5<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge, but this one doesn''t say simplicity to me very loudly. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, the combination of the DOF, perspective and lighting all give it a certain "look" that is very interesting and almost rock video-ish. Personal: I like the shot, but I don''t identify it with the challenge theme. My vote: 5', '2003-12-16 17:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(514726, 49828, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one does well. Staying warm is a basic, simple necessity. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. I like the fact that we see enough feathers to tell that this baby is snuggled up to Momma.<br/> <br/>Personal:The tiny featherlets (I just made up a word!) on the top of the baby''s head are precious. Excellent job catching all the fine details in this photo!<br/> <br/>My vote: 7<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This one does well. Staying warm is a basic, simple necessity. Exposure composition focus lighting all excellent. I like the fact that we see enough feathers to tell that this baby is snuggled up to Momma. Personal:The tiny featherlets (I just made up a word!) on the top of the baby''s head are precious. Excellent job catching all the fine details in this photo! My vote: 7', '2003-12-16 17:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(514728, 49918, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits well for me. I really expected more "Eastern" themed images for this challenge than were submitted! Exposure composition focus lighting all very good. <br/> <br/>Personal: This photograph makes me curious to know more about this kid, what he''s pointing at (if anything), what is behind him, where he is..... which means the photographer did a good job!<br/> <br/>My vote: 7<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits well for me. I really expected more "Eastern" themed images for this challenge than were submitted! Exposure composition focus lighting all very good.  Personal: This photograph makes me curious to know more about this kid, what he''s pointing at (if anything), what is behind him, where he is..... which means the photographer did a good job! My vote: 7', '2003-12-16 17:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(514731, 49619, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits well. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, I like the fact that the zip tie almost seems to glow. <br/> <br/>Personal: Well done shot, fits the theme well, it''s obvious this is a lock of some sort, but I find myself wanting to see more of what''s outside the frame to get a better understanding of what exactly I''m looking at.<br/> <br/>My vote: 7<br/></td>', 'Technical: Most all images submitted fit the challenge. This fits well. Exposure composition focus lighting all good, I like the fact that the zip tie almost seems to glow.  Personal: Well done shot, fits the theme well, it''s obvious this is a lock of some sort, but I find myself wanting to see more of what''s outside the frame to get a better understanding of what exactly I''m looking at. My vote: 7', '2003-12-16 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
