(514773, 50068, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but this is far too compressed.</td>', 'Nice idea, but this is far too compressed.', '2003-12-16 18:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514782, 49562, 543, '<td valign="top">Probably too subtle for this crowd.  Actualy a little too subtle for me, too.  I see where you''re headed, but I''m not following you there.</td>', 'Probably too subtle for this crowd.  Actualy a little too subtle for me, too.  I see where you''re headed, but I''m not following you there.', '2003-12-16 18:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(514789, 49698, 543, '<td valign="top">Lighting is so important for a still life like this, and the hard, direct quality of the light really hurts this image, IMO.  The composition could be more engaging, too, if you chose an angle different from the side-on POV you''ve got here.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, but the effect is reminiscent of ''I put this shell in my scanner''.  Photography can so easily devolve into ''holding a photocopier up to the world''.  It''s important to approach and treat your subject from a point of view that is somehow unique to your vision.  Hang in there!</td>', 'Lighting is so important for a still life like this, and the hard, direct quality of the light really hurts this image, IMO.  The composition could be more engaging, too, if you chose an angle different from the side-on POV you''ve got here.  I don''t mean to sound harsh, but the effect is reminiscent of ''I put this shell in my scanner''.  Photography can so easily devolve into ''holding a photocopier up to the world''.  It''s important to approach and treat your subject from a point of view that is somehow unique to your vision.  Hang in there!', '2003-12-16 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(514790, 50314, 2158, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here</td>', 'Enter your comment here', '2003-12-16 19:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(514797, 50015, 543, '<td valign="top">I''m torn between liking the shadow and not.  If the light were a little softer - enought to define the shadows without the specular highlights on the branch - it might play better.  Also, the purple background color is a choice I wouldn''t have made.</td>', 'I''m torn between liking the shadow and not.  If the light were a little softer - enought to define the shadows without the specular highlights on the branch - it might play better.  Also, the purple background color is a choice I wouldn''t have made.', '2003-12-16 19:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(514798, 49691, 543, '<td valign="top">A better white balance would capture the ambience of the lighting without the yellow wash over the image.  Looks inviting, otherwise.</td>', 'A better white balance would capture the ambience of the lighting without the yellow wash over the image.  Looks inviting, otherwise.', '2003-12-16 19:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(514800, 50330, 543, '<td valign="top">Pretty good control of the light here.  It would be more interesting, IMO, from a less usual POV, and maybe let depth of field come into play.  A good fit for the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty good control of the light here.  It would be more interesting, IMO, from a less usual POV, and maybe let depth of field come into play.  A good fit for the challenge.', '2003-12-16 19:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(514801, 49548, 6179, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the challenge. Great use of negative space to define an image.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the challenge. Great use of negative space to define an image.', '2003-12-16 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(514802, 50289, 543, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, if a bit static.  If it were mine, I''d have gotten in a little closer and lower down.  The lighting falls apart a bit, too.  The white side of the switch plate is distinctly gray.</td>', 'Nicely composed, if a bit static.  If it were mine, I''d have gotten in a little closer and lower down.  The lighting falls apart a bit, too.  The white side of the switch plate is distinctly gray.', '2003-12-16 19:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(514803, 49591, 6179, '<td valign="top">Nice bold lines. Very simple indeed.</td>', 'Nice bold lines. Very simple indeed.', '2003-12-16 19:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514805, 50000, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice mic.  I think you could have made a vertical composition and still had the subject off-center.  Not sure what the L side is adding here.</td>', 'Nice mic.  I think you could have made a vertical composition and still had the subject off-center.  Not sure what the L side is adding here.', '2003-12-16 19:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(514806, 49893, 543, '<td valign="top">It''d have been nice to see the ''face'' of the leaves rather than the side-on perspective.  And get a manicure.  &lt;g&gt;  Nice macro.</td>', 'It''d have been nice to see the ''face'' of the leaves rather than the side-on perspective.  And get a manicure.  <g>  Nice macro.', '2003-12-16 19:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(514807, 49549, 543, '<td valign="top">I''m very interested to learn how you did this.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''m very interested to learn how you did this.  Nice work.', '2003-12-16 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(514810, 49736, 543, '<td valign="top">Good, solid tech. here.  Dunno if the negative treatment adds anything that high contrast B/W wouldn''t have.  Not boring, anyway.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good, solid tech. here.  Dunno if the negative treatment adds anything that high contrast B/W wouldn''t have.  Not boring, anyway.  Nice work.', '2003-12-16 19:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(514811, 50215, 543, '<td valign="top">Maybe nicer without the subject right on the midline like that.  The big white empty at bottom doesn''t do much for the composition, IMO.</td>', 'Maybe nicer without the subject right on the midline like that.  The big white empty at bottom doesn''t do much for the composition, IMO.', '2003-12-16 19:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(514813, 49607, 7778, '<td valign="top">A unique find and photo. <br/>The extended pipe and vivid colours of yesterday''s radiator add a strong point of interest to this atmospheric image. The swathed out background aptly prevents any distraction.<br/> <br/>I wonder how a more distant perspective (one with the object clearly subordinated to the landscape) would have worked...</td>', 'A unique find and photo. The extended pipe and vivid colours of yesterday''s radiator add a strong point of interest to this atmospheric image. The swathed out background aptly prevents any distraction. I wonder how a more distant perspective (one with the object clearly subordinated to the landscape) would have worked...', '2003-12-16 19:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(514818, 50270, 7778, '<td valign="top">A difficult balance (the narrow depth of field vs. the retundity of the subject and the pedantic demands for sharpening such an image).<br/> <br/>I love the (unusual, deductive) choice of b and w and the formal but precise title. What crisp and minimal harmony. It suggests a marked style of shooting, to me.</td>', 'A difficult balance (the narrow depth of field vs. the retundity of the subject and the pedantic demands for sharpening such an image). I love the (unusual, deductive) choice of b and w and the formal but precise title. What crisp and minimal harmony. It suggests a marked style of shooting, to me.', '2003-12-16 19:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(514821, 49844, 7778, '<td valign="top">Now if this was hand-held, I''d be impressed! ;-)<br/> <br/>Beautiful, simple and flawless macro.</td>', 'Now if this was hand-held, I''d be impressed! ;-) Beautiful, simple and flawless macro.', '2003-12-16 19:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(514826, 50313, 7778, '<td valign="top">Such a humble request (title), I cannot help but accept the invitation, and I think the image does it justice.<br/> <br/>While some may object to the bud being crisper than the blossom or its right-of-center inclination, I am more given to the charm and natural elegance of this capture than to consider corrections. ;-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Such a humble request (title), I cannot help but accept the invitation, and I think the image does it justice. While some may object to the bud being crisper than the blossom or its right-of-center inclination, I am more given to the charm and natural elegance of this capture than to consider corrections. ;-) ', '2003-12-16 19:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(514832, 50082, 10492, '<td valign="top">lovely.</td>', 'lovely.', '2003-12-16 19:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(514834, 50145, 7778, '<td valign="top">Despite the extreme contrast, the image is worth cherishing. The grand piazza is well set against the bike with the sky nearly as swept.<br/> <br/>Very good natural composition, considerate of tonal balance. The near-central horizon really is where it should be given the vertical format.</td>', 'Despite the extreme contrast, the image is worth cherishing. The grand piazza is well set against the bike with the sky nearly as swept. Very good natural composition, considerate of tonal balance. The near-central horizon really is where it should be given the vertical format.', '2003-12-16 19:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(514846, 49918, 7778, '<td valign="top">A perfect photo of a perfect being with some minor and neglegible flaws. ;-) <br/>(The title, however, cannot match it).<br/> <br/>The intelligence of this young face, the gesture... striking! <br/></td>', 'A perfect photo of a perfect being with some minor and neglegible flaws. ;-) (The title, however, cannot match it). The intelligence of this young face, the gesture... striking! ', '2003-12-16 20:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(514850, 49828, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful closeup</td>', 'Beautiful closeup', '2003-12-16 20:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(514852, 50259, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition.  It might have been a good one to run through neat image on low settings to remove what looks like chroma noise in the light fur.</td>', 'I like the colors and composition.  It might have been a good one to run through neat image on low settings to remove what looks like chroma noise in the light fur.', '2003-12-16 20:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514856, 49975, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and use of symmetry.  I like the dark tones and richness it gives the colors.   The centered composition seems ok here, but as long as you have that, you might have just gone for broke and make the vases fill the frame vertically as well, giving complete symmetry of the composition as well.</td>', 'Excellent shot and use of symmetry.  I like the dark tones and richness it gives the colors.   The centered composition seems ok here, but as long as you have that, you might have just gone for broke and make the vases fill the frame vertically as well, giving complete symmetry of the composition as well.', '2003-12-16 20:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514858, 50329, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and tones.  Would like it even more without the glass shelf.</td>', 'Very nice light and tones.  Would like it even more without the glass shelf.', '2003-12-16 20:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(514862, 50231, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot and design.  Has it been desaturated?  Looks a little on the green side, might be natural.  But perhaps a little more saturation or yellow in the flowers would punch it up a notch.</td>', 'Good shot and design.  Has it been desaturated?  Looks a little on the green side, might be natural.  But perhaps a little more saturation or yellow in the flowers would punch it up a notch.', '2003-12-16 20:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(514864, 49790, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting here.  I think it would be improved if you could have eliminated the spot from the shot though.</td>', 'I like the lighting here.  I think it would be improved if you could have eliminated the spot from the shot though.', '2003-12-16 20:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(514866, 50154, 12253, '<td valign="top">A very good shot.  I am betting it ribbons!</td>', 'A very good shot.  I am betting it ribbons!', '2003-12-16 20:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(514871, 49611, 12179, '<td valign="top">this is disturbing for some reason</td>', 'this is disturbing for some reason', '2003-12-16 20:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(514874, 50125, 7151, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but my only real complaint is the compostion - moving everything to the right would have let the center be focused on the forks, which seem to me to be the point of interest.  Other than that, well captured, great idea - I like it.</td>', 'A little dark, but my only real complaint is the compostion - moving everything to the right would have let the center be focused on the forks, which seem to me to be the point of interest.  Other than that, well captured, great idea - I like it.', '2003-12-16 20:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(514877, 50105, 7151, '<td valign="top">Title should have been... simpler.  :)  Don''t force the theme down the viewer''s throught - "Discarded" would have been sufficient and much more effective.  The idea of the leaf, the detail of the photo and the lighting (and shadows) are all good.  The composition could have been improved by a different placement of the leaf in the frame - closer, farther away, more to the top seems like it might have worked better to me.  Overall, I like it.</td>', 'Title should have been... simpler.  :)  Don''t force the theme down the viewer''s throught - "Discarded" would have been sufficient and much more effective.  The idea of the leaf, the detail of the photo and the lighting (and shadows) are all good.  The composition could have been improved by a different placement of the leaf in the frame - closer, farther away, more to the top seems like it might have worked better to me.  Overall, I like it.', '2003-12-16 20:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(514879, 50107, 13776, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this shot.  Steeper falloff in the back would be nicer to me.... as in the background going into total darkness behind the people.  I like the simple effect of a single light on the subject. Good job!</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this shot.  Steeper falloff in the back would be nicer to me.... as in the background going into total darkness behind the people.  I like the simple effect of a single light on the subject. Good job!', '2003-12-16 20:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(514880, 49736, 11738, '<td valign="top">This rocks as far as a negative shot goes.  Crystal clear and very clean.  I''m impressed.  Good work.  A little bit blown out on the left edge of the camera.</td>', 'This rocks as far as a negative shot goes.  Crystal clear and very clean.  I''m impressed.  Good work.  A little bit blown out on the left edge of the camera.', '2003-12-16 20:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(514881, 49681, 7151, '<td valign="top">Why leave the drops on the glass?  They seem to me to clutter up the "simple" composition.  The lighting and colors are nice; the focus is interesting.</td>', 'Why leave the drops on the glass?  They seem to me to clutter up the "simple" composition.  The lighting and colors are nice; the focus is interesting.', '2003-12-16 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(514883, 49610, 12179, '<td valign="top">This is the goods! Very simple yet provocative at the same time!</td>', 'This is the goods! Very simple yet provocative at the same time!', '2003-12-16 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(514884, 50314, 12179, '<td valign="top">This is the goods! Very simple yet provocative at the same time!</td>', 'This is the goods! Very simple yet provocative at the same time!', '2003-12-16 20:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(514885, 50038, 7151, '<td valign="top">Love it.  The humor works well here.</td>', 'Love it.  The humor works well here.', '2003-12-16 20:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(514887, 49698, 11738, '<td valign="top">This could have been very interesting but the lighting is bad.  Try having more ambient light in the room ontop of the spotlight.  I think this would reduce the harshness of the central part of the subject and would help the fading sen on the left.  The colour of the object isn''t that appealing either.  A B&amp;W or sepia treatment might be better.  Keep trying and good luck.</td>', 'This could have been very interesting but the lighting is bad.  Try having more ambient light in the room ontop of the spotlight.  I think this would reduce the harshness of the central part of the subject and would help the fading sen on the left.  The colour of the object isn''t that appealing either.  A B&W or sepia treatment might be better.  Keep trying and good luck.', '2003-12-16 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(514890, 50152, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  However, I do find that the difference in light at the top and bottom of the photo a bit distracting.  Very impressed how you got the spoon to look so smooth and I love the reflection in it.  The reflection in the plate is also sweet.  Good work.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  However, I do find that the difference in light at the top and bottom of the photo a bit distracting.  Very impressed how you got the spoon to look so smooth and I love the reflection in it.  The reflection in the plate is also sweet.  Good work.', '2003-12-16 21:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514891, 49874, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and fills challenge requirement bang on.  The end of the stem does seem a little out of focus.  The bright circular reflection on the cherry is a little distracting as well.  Love the shadow.</td>', 'Nice shot and fills challenge requirement bang on.  The end of the stem does seem a little out of focus.  The bright circular reflection on the cherry is a little distracting as well.  Love the shadow.', '2003-12-16 21:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
