(514922, 50253, 11738, '<td valign="top">Dirty mallet takes away from this shot.</td>', 'Dirty mallet takes away from this shot.', '2003-12-16 21:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(514923, 49929, 11738, '<td valign="top">Title suits this shot very well.</td>', 'Title suits this shot very well.', '2003-12-16 21:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(514927, 49929, 8816, '<td valign="top">Very very nice shot, I tried to do a shot similar to this with wine glasses for the shapes challenge, but ended up with something very different.  I never even thought about using martini glasses, well done. Looks like you got some glare or reflection on three of the glasses though, you might have had to push your lighting source further under the table (if that''s how you lit it, and if not how did you light it?).  If you wanted to add some color to the shot you could have done so using the hue/saturation adjustments in PS, that''s how I did it in my Shapes entry.  Very nice nontheless 9!<br/> <br/>I just took another look at your shot, and realized that I didn''t read the title.  HAHA ignore what I said about the reflections/glare lol.  Nice shot again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-17 00:31:38.</i></td>', 'Very very nice shot, I tried to do a shot similar to this with wine glasses for the shapes challenge, but ended up with something very different.  I never even thought about using martini glasses, well done. Looks like you got some glare or reflection on three of the glasses though, you might have had to push your lighting source further under the table (if that''s how you lit it, and if not how did you light it?).  If you wanted to add some color to the shot you could have done so using the hue/saturation adjustments in PS, that''s how I did it in my Shapes entry.  Very nice nontheless 9! I just took another look at your shot, and realized that I didn''t read the title.  HAHA ignore what I said about the reflections/glare lol.  Nice shot again!', '2003-12-16 21:47:28.000000', '2003-12-17 00:31:38.000000', 1),
(514928, 49640, 3084, '<td valign="top">Superb  10  Morgan</td>', 'Superb  10  Morgan', '2003-12-16 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
