(514931, 50077, 11738, '<td valign="top">This shot looks oversharpened.  Lots of artifacts around the edges of the old dead tree.  Too bad, since this is a very dramatic shot.  I also find that the frame is a bit much.  A thinner frame would have made for a larger image and might have avoided the artifacts.  Nice composition.</td>', 'This shot looks oversharpened.  Lots of artifacts around the edges of the old dead tree.  Too bad, since this is a very dramatic shot.  I also find that the frame is a bit much.  A thinner frame would have made for a larger image and might have avoided the artifacts.  Nice composition.', '2003-12-16 21:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(514932, 50000, 8816, '<td valign="top">I wish I had had a mic like this to use for my propaganda shot.  Well done shot, and a very nice mic!</td>', 'I wish I had had a mic like this to use for my propaganda shot.  Well done shot, and a very nice mic!', '2003-12-16 21:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
