(514943, 49716, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: This is very creative, but it doesn''t say simplicity to me. Exposure composition lighting good, but focus seems off and there appears to be a lot of noise in the image!<br/> <br/>Personal: I think this shot has a lot of potential- but I''d say a cleaner, sharper image would have made it stronger.<br/> <br/>My vote: 4<br/></td>', 'Technical: This is very creative, but it doesn''t say simplicity to me. Exposure composition lighting good, but focus seems off and there appears to be a lot of noise in the image! Personal: I think this shot has a lot of potential- but I''d say a cleaner, sharper image would have made it stronger. My vote: 4', '2003-12-16 22:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
