(514977, 50223, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great colors and texture contrasts, excellent detail, superb composition and you had to go ruin it, at least for me, with a frame and a white one at that.  What is it with the frames here, I''ll ask again.  ALL other sites request that pictures not have frames....why here?????</td>', 'Great colors and texture contrasts, excellent detail, superb composition and you had to go ruin it, at least for me, with a frame and a white one at that.  What is it with the frames here, I''ll ask again.  ALL other sites request that pictures not have frames....why here?????', '2003-12-16 22:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
