(514995, 50231, 8891, '<td valign="top">the colors, especiallyh the superb shite of the flowers, lighting and detail on this are excellent....but it is not a very interesting composition at all, imho.</td>', 'the colors, especiallyh the superb shite of the flowers, lighting and detail on this are excellent....but it is not a very interesting composition at all, imho.', '2003-12-16 23:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(514996, 50074, 8891, '<td valign="top">Grteat colors and exposure, excellent composition....like this a lot....of course there is always a nit....much of the blue in the bottom right of the playground structure is not very discernible...I''ll let the simplicity of the composition override that.  10</td>', 'Grteat colors and exposure, excellent composition....like this a lot....of course there is always a nit....much of the blue in the bottom right of the playground structure is not very discernible...I''ll let the simplicity of the composition override that.  10', '2003-12-16 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(514998, 50199, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is perfect! 10<br/>I''m not sure how to improve on this, maybe just a bit more light on the bottom to even things out??? I like the way it fades, but it might be just a little too dark. <br/></td>', 'This is perfect! 10I''m not sure how to improve on this, maybe just a bit more light on the bottom to even things out??? I like the way it fades, but it might be just a little too dark. ', '2003-12-16 23:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(515003, 50278, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is so great! The colors are bright, the subject is simple. 10</td>', 'This is so great! The colors are bright, the subject is simple. 10', '2003-12-16 23:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(515007, 50016, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photograph! I think it''s just a bit busy and a little technical for a "simplicity challenge." However, as lighting goes, you did capture the essence of simplicity.  I''m giving this a 7<br/></td>', 'This is an awesome photograph! I think it''s just a bit busy and a little technical for a "simplicity challenge." However, as lighting goes, you did capture the essence of simplicity.  I''m giving this a 7', '2003-12-16 23:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(515009, 49600, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is so perfect for this challenge!<br/>My only suggestion is; the clarity of the dots is a little soft or something to me. <br/>I think if you utilized the allotted file size it might help this out.<br/>You are only at 46,979 bytes and you can go up to 150,000 bytes.<br/>You might play with the compression a little and max it out in future challenges to improve the clarity of your shots.   It still gets a 9 from me.    :)</td>', 'This is so perfect for this challenge!My only suggestion is; the clarity of the dots is a little soft or something to me. I think if you utilized the allotted file size it might help this out.You are only at 46,979 bytes and you can go up to 150,000 bytes.You might play with the compression a little and max it out in future challenges to improve the clarity of your shots.   It still gets a 9 from me.    :)', '2003-12-16 23:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(515015, 49873, 14045, '<td valign="top">very nice stop action</td>', 'very nice stop action', '2003-12-16 23:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
