(515035, 49850, 9668, '<td valign="top">That''s funny that you would win shapes with a picture very simalar to this and and get 127th on this. (probably on the same exact beach in France.)</td>', 'That''s funny that you would win shapes with a picture very simalar to this and and get 127th on this. (probably on the same exact beach in France.)', '2003-12-17 00:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(515040, 49792, 10818, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i>very strange to have it B&amp;W except the blue. The effect does not add anything, just distracts.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My thoughts also.  I was not fond of the blue dress.  I liked the picture though.</td>', 'Originally posted by willem:very strange to have it B&W except the blue. The effect does not add anything, just distracts.  My thoughts also.  I was not fond of the blue dress.  I liked the picture though.', '2003-12-17 00:19:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(515060, 49792, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea!  However, while it meets the theme topically, it doesn''t meet it compositionally.  The composition is crowded, and while there is a focal point (the person), they are partly obscured, bent over the other way, and facing the other way.  <br/> <br/>IMHO there were a number of ways to approch this.  The key would have been to reduce the number of elements in the photo as well as capturing a portrait of the simple life.  On the other side of the post would have been a good start.  Catching just the one carriage, perhaps even as she pulled away, would have worked as well.  <br/></td>', 'This was a good idea!  However, while it meets the theme topically, it doesn''t meet it compositionally.  The composition is crowded, and while there is a focal point (the person), they are partly obscured, bent over the other way, and facing the other way.   IMHO there were a number of ways to approch this.  The key would have been to reduce the number of elements in the photo as well as capturing a portrait of the simple life.  On the other side of the post would have been a good start.  Catching just the one carriage, perhaps even as she pulled away, would have worked as well.  ', '2003-12-17 00:56:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(515066, 50152, 11078, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this I didnt think much of it but a closer look and it really is beautiful I like it very much Well done the poor saucer or plate didnt get a mention they both look great together.</td>', 'When I first looked at this I didnt think much of it but a closer look and it really is beautiful I like it very much Well done the poor saucer or plate didnt get a mention they both look great together.', '2003-12-17 01:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(515111, 50067, 8891, '<td valign="top">Excellent showing,Tom! Good luck in your next challenge.</td>', 'Excellent showing,Tom! Good luck in your next challenge.', '2003-12-17 02:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(515126, 50194, 10170, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand that comment there banmorn.  This shot does not show a vagina, or even close to one.  I think you maybe need to look up the definition ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I don''t understand that comment there banmorn.  This shot does not show a vagina, or even close to one.  I think you maybe need to look up the definition ;) ', '2003-12-17 02:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(515151, 50152, 3585, '<td valign="top">you won''t be surprised I do like the aspet ratio...Good composition and great spoon shadows. Congratulations our first meeting on the front page.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-26 02:47:22.</i></td>', 'you won''t be surprised I do like the aspet ratio...Good composition and great spoon shadows. Congratulations our first meeting on the front page.', '2003-12-17 02:58:20.000000', '2010-11-26 02:47:22.000000', 0),
(515180, 49853, 1570, '<td valign="top">thanks a lot for your helpful and positive comments!</td>', 'thanks a lot for your helpful and positive comments!', '2003-12-17 03:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(515205, 49893, 5158, '<td valign="top">Thanx for all votes bringing the image on the 10th place. And thanks to all who gave comments and critique.<br/>Actually I''m a little surprised that it ended that high: I didn''t like the image very much when I finally submitted it: the background is not what I wanted and I didn''t like how the fingers looked (beside bad manicure). But I didn''t want to redo it again and again.<br/> <br/>It shows a cress-plant hold between my two little fingers. It was a difficult task: I had to press the button of the camera and then, during the 10 s of the self-timer, had to grab the plant with my fingers and place it in the right distance to the camera. Fortunately the G3 has focus bracketing when shooting with manual focus.<br/></td>', 'Thanx for all votes bringing the image on the 10th place. And thanks to all who gave comments and critique.Actually I''m a little surprised that it ended that high: I didn''t like the image very much when I finally submitted it: the background is not what I wanted and I didn''t like how the fingers looked (beside bad manicure). But I didn''t want to redo it again and again. It shows a cress-plant hold between my two little fingers. It was a difficult task: I had to press the button of the camera and then, during the 10 s of the self-timer, had to grab the plant with my fingers and place it in the right distance to the camera. Fortunately the G3 has focus bracketing when shooting with manual focus.', '2003-12-17 03:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(515213, 50072, 14715, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t place higher.  It was one of three 10''s I gave.  Abstract, good color, great cropping.  Border was lacking a little, but I felt the picture made up for it.  <br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t place higher.  It was one of three 10''s I gave.  Abstract, good color, great cropping.  Border was lacking a little, but I felt the picture made up for it.   Nice shot.', '2003-12-17 03:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(515236, 49548, 13218, '<td valign="top">Wow.. thank you all for your kind words. <br/>Thank you<br/>Kiss and Love<br/>BIliana</td>', 'Wow.. thank you all for your kind words. Thank youKiss and LoveBIliana', '2003-12-17 04:19:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(515290, 50221, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition. The highlight on the cheek is very nice. I would have liked a larger picture. The grain of the wood is almost teasing your eyes. You can kind of make them out but not the details. Using B&amp;W on this one makes it really moody. The black background helps to really bring out the moon. Gave you a "9" on this one.<br/> <br/>Just noticed that this is my 1000th comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-17 05:44:32.</i></td>', 'Nice simple composition. The highlight on the cheek is very nice. I would have liked a larger picture. The grain of the wood is almost teasing your eyes. You can kind of make them out but not the details. Using B&W on this one makes it really moody. The black background helps to really bring out the moon. Gave you a "9" on this one. Just noticed that this is my 1000th comment.', '2003-12-17 05:41:47.000000', '2003-12-17 05:44:32.000000', 0),
(515296, 50152, 6999, '<td valign="top">Damn - wanted third, to complete the set of ribbons :-)<br/> <br/>Thanks for all comments - nothing about noise? - and all votes. I''m surprised by the contrast comment - though I know what is meant. <br/> <br/>JJ - indeed nice to meet on the homepage, though as ever you''re at least one step ahead ...<br/> <br/>I was surprised (and delighted) by this placing; I''ve switched off my scores on the front page, and so had no idea where this was scoring, and it didn''t seem to have enough comments to be rating this highly, and i really thought it was too subtle (or just plain dark) to do so well here.</td>', 'Damn - wanted third, to complete the set of ribbons :-) Thanks for all comments - nothing about noise? - and all votes. I''m surprised by the contrast comment - though I know what is meant.  JJ - indeed nice to meet on the homepage, though as ever you''re at least one step ahead ... I was surprised (and delighted) by this placing; I''ve switched off my scores on the front page, and so had no idea where this was scoring, and it didn''t seem to have enough comments to be rating this highly, and i really thought it was too subtle (or just plain dark) to do so well here.', '2003-12-17 05:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(515299, 50152, 5728, '<td valign="top">Congrats Ed, good on ya.</td>', 'Congrats Ed, good on ya.', '2003-12-17 05:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(515300, 50152, 4482, '<td valign="top">Congrats Ed! Love this one!! :-)</td>', 'Congrats Ed! Love this one!! :-)', '2003-12-17 06:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(515306, 50223, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now I thought this would win - I guess you placed pretty well, but I was sure I was going to see it on the front page.</td>', 'Now I thought this would win - I guess you placed pretty well, but I was sure I was going to see it on the front page.', '2003-12-17 06:20:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(515322, 50112, 5822, '<td valign="top">This is  a gem of a shot! I love it so much. You''ve captured so well the shear joy of childhood in a winter scene. It appears spontaneous and natural with no pretense and I like how all distractions have been eliminated. It''s so universal a scene as well...who doesn''t remember scenes like this when they were growing up.  It''s a great portrait, as well as, a great photographic accomplishment. Congratulations on a job well done.</td>', 'This is  a gem of a shot! I love it so much. You''ve captured so well the shear joy of childhood in a winter scene. It appears spontaneous and natural with no pretense and I like how all distractions have been eliminated. It''s so universal a scene as well...who doesn''t remember scenes like this when they were growing up.  It''s a great portrait, as well as, a great photographic accomplishment. Congratulations on a job well done.', '2003-12-17 06:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(515388, 49792, 14012, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you that have taken the time to comment on my shot. It is very much appreciated!</td>', 'Thanks to all of you that have taken the time to comment on my shot. It is very much appreciated!', '2003-12-17 08:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(515420, 50255, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, especially with the Fuji 3800. This deserved a better finish Jack. I enjoy watching your entries and am inspired. I am a 3800 owner too!</td>', 'Nice capture, especially with the Fuji 3800. This deserved a better finish Jack. I enjoy watching your entries and am inspired. I am a 3800 owner too!', '2003-12-17 09:01:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(515423, 49489, 6771, '<td valign="top">Composition is good.  Focus, color, and sharpness are very good.  I like the lighting also, with the shadows faint and not overpowering.<br/>I do see some kind of artifact in the upper left.  I would like to see the books more evenly spaced in the frame as it is set up.  One corner of the book is out of frame on the left.  Evenly spaced I mean throughout, like the top standing book an equal distance from the edges, etc.  I think it is a bit better than 5.131 (is average), but the specific challenge may have affected that, with many people not getting the gist of it.</td>', 'Composition is good.  Focus, color, and sharpness are very good.  I like the lighting also, with the shadows faint and not overpowering.I do see some kind of artifact in the upper left.  I would like to see the books more evenly spaced in the frame as it is set up.  One corner of the book is out of frame on the left.  Evenly spaced I mean throughout, like the top standing book an equal distance from the edges, etc.  I think it is a bit better than 5.131 (is average), but the specific challenge may have affected that, with many people not getting the gist of it.', '2003-12-17 09:02:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(515427, 50301, 14048, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments about the hammer missing the nail.  Actually I started the exposure with the hammer ON the nail, then slowly raised it.  After looking closely at the photo I realized that the nail raised slightly after I lifted the hammer.  I took the photo in my living room, on top of my cushioned piano bench.  I didn''t think about the cushion compressing under the weight of the hammer!  But that''s what this site is all about...learning from your mistakes!</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments about the hammer missing the nail.  Actually I started the exposure with the hammer ON the nail, then slowly raised it.  After looking closely at the photo I realized that the nail raised slightly after I lifted the hammer.  I took the photo in my living room, on top of my cushioned piano bench.  I didn''t think about the cushion compressing under the weight of the hammer!  But that''s what this site is all about...learning from your mistakes!', '2003-12-17 09:05:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(515449, 49443, 14369, '<td valign="top">This photo was meant to be slightly blurry, focused, colors meant that way, as well as shadow...was supposed to imply simplicity in all aspects. I wished it would have done better...but oh well..maybe next time. If it were more detailed...then it would not be SIMPLE.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-17 09:22:07.</i></td>', 'This photo was meant to be slightly blurry, focused, colors meant that way, as well as shadow...was supposed to imply simplicity in all aspects. I wished it would have done better...but oh well..maybe next time. If it were more detailed...then it would not be SIMPLE.', '2003-12-17 09:20:57.000000', '2003-12-17 09:22:07.000000', 0),
(515477, 50152, 6624, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red ribbon, very fine image.</td>', 'Congratulations on the red ribbon, very fine image.', '2003-12-17 09:56:11.000000', NULL, 0),
