(515498, 50152, 1779, '<td valign="top">great job. loved your initial comments about what people might said. they''re right on (the comments not the people).<br/> <br/>very elegant job. I do love the composition and the fact that yoyu CAN''T se all the plate. and that it''s a bit DARK, etc...<br/> <br/>simple and beautiful.<br/> <br/>LM</td>', 'great job. loved your initial comments about what people might said. they''re right on (the comments not the people). very elegant job. I do love the composition and the fact that yoyu CAN''T se all the plate. and that it''s a bit DARK, etc... simple and beautiful. LM', '2003-12-17 10:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
