(519378, 50083, 7350, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>This shot did fairly well, and I can see why.  Black and White was a good choice for this, as it really brought out the simplicity.  Perhaps the contrast/lighting made the image a little flat, keeping it from reaching the "6" mark.<br/> <br/>I think the composition is perfect.  I like how you have the trees in the front like that.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a great shot!<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! This shot did fairly well, and I can see why.  Black and White was a good choice for this, as it really brought out the simplicity.  Perhaps the contrast/lighting made the image a little flat, keeping it from reaching the "6" mark. I think the composition is perfect.  I like how you have the trees in the front like that. Congratulations on a great shot! Steve', '2003-12-21 23:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
