(519860, 50001, 14256, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by amsmyth:</b></div><hr/><i>there are too many distractions in this image, the light is uneven and picks up wrinkles in the background, the shadow fights with the line of the backdrop without being clear enough and the crumbs and lack of focus in the foregroun do not work for me</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot for critics. I can say I do that photo with no any photo eqipment. Just old piece of paper and regular lamp. I did not use any filters or other improvements and I it is really helpfull that I must do much more next time.<br/>Thanks again and wish you all the best in 2004.<br/> <br/>Regards<br/>Amin</td>', 'Originally posted by amsmyth:there are too many distractions in this image, the light is uneven and picks up wrinkles in the background, the shadow fights with the line of the backdrop without being clear enough and the crumbs and lack of focus in the foregroun do not work for me  Thanks a lot for critics. I can say I do that photo with no any photo eqipment. Just old piece of paper and regular lamp. I did not use any filters or other improvements and I it is really helpfull that I must do much more next time.Thanks again and wish you all the best in 2004. RegardsAmin', '2003-12-22 10:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
