(5480304, 49918, 93883, '<td valign="top">First of all, this photo is absolutely excellent.  Secondly, I have a question.  I teach primary students in China, and this little sign he''s making with his hand means the number eight in China, and eight is a lucky number here.  So all the kids make this sign and it''s supposed to be a really cool thing to do.  Something akin to chunking the deuce in the states or flashing a peace sign.  Does it mean something similar in Thailand?</td>', 'First of all, this photo is absolutely excellent.  Secondly, I have a question.  I teach primary students in China, and this little sign he''s making with his hand means the number eight in China, and eight is a lucky number here.  So all the kids make this sign and it''s supposed to be a really cool thing to do.  Something akin to chunking the deuce in the states or flashing a peace sign.  Does it mean something similar in Thailand?', '2009-05-11 08:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
